Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stasis interrupted。Fire in cryogenic compartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.87,0:02:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Repeat。Fire in cryogenic compartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.46,0:02:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,All personnel report to…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.46,0:02:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,emergency escape vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.26,0:02:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Launch of the escape lifeboat will commence…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,in T-minus 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.83,0:06:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,An E.E.V.'s come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.05,0:06:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down to the beach。There may be others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.21,0:06:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.67,0:06:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.01,0:06:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Frank！Come on！Let's go！Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get goin'，Frank。Get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Jesus Christ！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hell of a way to make a landing！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Use the torch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:08:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How many？- Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.89,0:08:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three。Maybe four.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Frank。Can we hurry this up？It's gonna be 40 below in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，all right。Let's get it going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep it together。Come on。Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Here we go，Mr。Dillon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.10,0:09:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give us strength，O Lord，to endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.89,0:09:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We recognize that we are poor sinners in the hands of an angry God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let the circle be unbroken…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.82,0:09:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,until the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.74,0:10:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Amen。- Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，gentlemen。This is rumor control.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here are the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.59,0:10:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,As some of you know，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.17,0:10:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,a 337 model E.E.V…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.63,0:10:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,crash-landed here at 0600…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,on the morning watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,There was one survivor，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,two dead and a droid that was hopelessly smashed beyond repair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.88,0:10:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,The survivor is a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.38,0:10:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just want to say that I've taken a vow of celibacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So have we all。- That also includes women.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.43,0:10:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes。- We've all taken the vow！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shut your gob，Morse。- I'd like to say that I，for one，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.35,0:10:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,do not appreciate company policy allowing her to freely…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:10:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,intermingle with inmates and the rest of the staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:11:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,What brother means to say is we view the presence of any outsider，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.90,0:11:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,especially a woman，as a violation of the harmony，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.61,0:11:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,a potential break in the spiritual unity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are well aware of your feelings in this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will be pleased to know that I have requested a rescue team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hopefully，they will be here inside of a week-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.75,0:11:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on！and evacuate her A.S.A.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't give us that！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's her medical status？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,She doesn't seem too badly damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.84,0:11:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's unconscious。Can't give you a more specific diagnosis at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Will she live？- I would think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.98,0:11:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。It's in everybody's interest…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.98,0:11:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,the woman doesn't come out of the infirmary until the rescue team arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And certainly not without an escort，right？- Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gentlemen，we should all stick to our set routine…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,and not get unduly agitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.87,0:11:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Correct？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Thank you，gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Better get here soon or there ain't gonna be much left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.55,0:12:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just a little cocktail of my own mix。Sort of eye-opener.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.68,0:12:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You a doctor？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.18,0:13:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name is Clemens。I'm the chief medical officer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.81,0:13:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Here？- Fury 161.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's one of Weyland-Yutani's backwater work prisons，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,it grieves me to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you mind？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is basically a stabilizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.12,0:13:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really ought to shave your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have a big problem with lice here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.71,0:13:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,And when you're feeling better，I'll give you some clippers，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.33,0:13:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- and you can tend to your private parts yourself。- How'd I get here？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You crash-landed in an E.E.V.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.55,0:13:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Evidently separated from your mother ship before you hit our atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.14,0:13:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have any idea how long you were in hypersleep？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.56,0:13:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause coming out the way you did can be quite a jolt to the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，I'll be sick for a couple of weeks。- Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.69,0:13:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where are the others？- They didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- They didn't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.49,0:14:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to get to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Have to get to the ship。- You're in no condition for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.12,0:14:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to get me some clothes，or should I just go like this？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.09,0:14:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Given the nature of our indigenous population，I would suggest clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,None of them have seen a woman in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Neither have I，for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,This used to be a 5，000 convict facility，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.43,0:14:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,but it's been reduced to a custodial staff of 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.18,0:14:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Keep the pilot light on。- The pilot light for what？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blast furnace。Natural methane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.94,0:14:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have a foundry，Lieutenant Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,The inmates forge lead sheets for toxic waste containers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you know my name？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's stenciled on the back of your shorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.34,0:15:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Release the cable！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where are the bodies？- We have a morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,We put them there until the investigative team arrives in about a week，I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There was a droid。- Disconnected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.37,0:15:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,There were bits and pieces of him all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,We put what was left on the rubbish tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,The corporal was impaled by that safety support.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,He never knew what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the girl？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.09,0:15:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,She drowned in her cryo-tube.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think she was conscious when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um，I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the matter？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where is she？- In the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to see what's left of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.01,0:16:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there any particular reason that you're so insistent？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。I have to be sure how she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate to be repetitious about such a sensitive subject，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.15,0:16:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,but it is persectly clear that she drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.57,0:17:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was she your daughter？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。She wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,C-Could I have a moment alone，please？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's she doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.55,0:19:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.14,0:19:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.43,0:19:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to do an autopsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.43,0:19:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- I told you，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,we have to make sure how she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.90,0:19:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I told you，she drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.28,0:19:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure。I-I have to see inside of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're disorientated。Half your system's still in-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.41,0:19:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a very，very good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.49,0:19:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，perhaps you'd like to share that reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.83,0:19:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Possible contagion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.79,0:19:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,What kind exactly？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.76,0:19:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cholera。- Cholera？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,There hasn't been a case of cholera reported for 200 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.98,0:20:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.48,0:20:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything's in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no sign of infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No indication of disease。- Chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open the chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.16,0:21:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Flooded with fluid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.20,0:21:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ergo，she drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，since I'm not a complete idiot，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.55,0:21:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,would you like to tell me what we're really looking for？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.31,0:22:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Clemens.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.73,0:22:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Superintendent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.32,0:22:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't believe you've met Lieutenant Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.82,0:22:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on，Mr。Clemens？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.91,0:22:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right，sir。What's going on，Mr。Clemens？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.41,0:22:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，first-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.50,0:22:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,the lieutenant is feeling much better，I'm happy to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.42,0:22:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Second，in the interest of public health，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.01,0:22:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I am performing an autopsy。- Without my authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.76,0:22:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，there didn't seem to be time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.26,0:22:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it's turned out all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.26,0:22:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There's no sign of contagion in the body。- Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.76,0:22:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it might be helpful if Lt。Ripley didn't parade around in front of the prisoners，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.60,0:22:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,as I am told she did in the last hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.81,0:22:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,It might also be helpful…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.81,0:22:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you kept me informed as to any change in her physical status.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.94,0:22:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or would that be asking too much？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to cremate the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.15,0:22:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nonsense。We'll keep the bodies on ice till the rescue team arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.91,0:23:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- On ice。- There is the public health issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.37,0:23:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,The lieutenant feels that there is still a possibility of a communicable infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.46,0:23:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you said there was no sign of disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.80,0:23:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,It would appear that the child drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.01,0:23:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,But without the benefit of proper laboratory tests，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.64,0:23:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's impossible to be absolutely certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.64,0:23:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would consider it unwise…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.97,0:23:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,to tolerate even the possibility of an unwelcome virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.81,0:23:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,An outbreak of cholera would look extremely bad on a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.40,0:23:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would it not，sir？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.03,0:23:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've 25 prisoners in this facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.86,0:23:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,All double-y-chromos.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.03,0:23:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,All thieves，rapists，murderers，child molesters。All scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.33,0:23:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just because they've taken on religion doesn't make them any less dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.17,0:23:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I try not to offend their convictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.67,0:23:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to upset the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.34,0:23:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want ripples in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.84,0:24:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I don't want a woman walking around giving them ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.93,0:24:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see。For my own personal safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.14,0:24:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.19,0:24:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will leave the details of the cremation to you，Mr。Clemens.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.19,0:24:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,They may use the furnace，but I want everyone back in lockup by 2200 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.32,0:24:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You called it，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.56,0:24:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ah，Christmas has come early，Murph。- What do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.98,0:24:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Any dead ox is a good ox。- You're bloody right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.07,0:24:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smelly bastards，all covered in lice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.40,0:25:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's only seven of the friggin' things left，and then we're done with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.49,0:25:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,God，I hates hosin' these bastards down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.87,0:25:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I always get shite all over me boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.45,0:25:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Talkin' of hosing things down，Frank-Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.67,0:25:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You had the chance，what would you say to her？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.33,0:25:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do you mean，if I got the chance？- You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.67,0:25:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you got the chance。You mean，casual like？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.55,0:25:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I mean，how would you put it to her if you bumped into her in the mess hall or somewhere？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.89,0:25:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,No problem！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.01,0:25:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've never had any problem with the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.02,0:25:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd say to her，「Good day，my dear。How's it goin'？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.02,0:25:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything I can do to be of service？「
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.73,0:25:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then I'd give her the look，you know-up and down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.78,0:25:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'd give her the wink，the dirty smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.24,0:25:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She'd soon get the picture。- Yeah，right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.78,0:25:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then she'd say，「Kiss my ass，you horny old fucker！」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.54,0:25:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to kiss her ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.29,0:25:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to kiss her anywhere she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.37,0:25:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，but treat 'em mean，keep 'em keen。Right，Frank？- Told you before，Murph.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.25,0:26:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Treat a queen like a whore and a whore like a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.09,0:26:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.61,0:26:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you think killed Babe？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.77,0:26:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Beats me。She just keeled over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.48,0:26:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How old was she？- The charts say 11 .
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.10,0:26:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,In her prime。Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.28,0:26:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We'll chop her up later and throw her in the stew。- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.24,0:26:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.24,0:26:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's this？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.39,0:27:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,「We commit this child…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.39,0:27:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,and this man to your keeping，O Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.98,0:27:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Their bodies…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.32,0:27:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,have been taken from the shadow of our nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.95,0:27:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,They have been released…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.99,0:27:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,from all darkness and pain.「
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.21,0:28:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,「The child and the man…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.55,0:28:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,have gone beyond our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.22,0:28:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are forever eternal…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.10,0:28:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,and everlasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.57,0:28:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ashes to ashes，dust to dust.「
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.03,0:28:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.91,0:28:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are the innocent punished？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.13,0:28:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why the sacrifice？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.80,0:28:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why the pain？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.34,0:28:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,There aren't any promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.47,0:28:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing's certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only that some get called，some get saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.69,0:29:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,She won't ever know the hardship and grief…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.57,0:29:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,for those of us left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.28,0:29:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,We commit these bodies to the void…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.03,0:29:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,with a glad heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.51,0:29:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,For within each seed，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.51,0:29:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,there is a promise of a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.97,0:29:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,And within each death，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.10,0:29:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,no matter how small，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.44,0:29:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,there's always a new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.69,0:29:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,A new beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.91,0:29:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.87,0:30:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.24,0:30:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll tell you，it's fucking weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.15,0:30:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only one to survive that crash is a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.91,0:30:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,What trouble can she cause？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.12,0:30:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's already changed everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.25,0:30:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck are we supposed to do-
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.97,0:30:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I，for one-
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.39,0:31:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean it！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.09,0:31:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.26,0:31:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a lot of talk going around that we've got some disharmony here？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.81,0:31:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any you guys want to tell me what the problem is？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.44,0:31:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Speak to me，brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.28,0:32:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。I'll tell ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.28,0:32:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't mind the dark。I don't mind the bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.08,0:32:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't mind wanderin' around in some cold，wet，damp tunnel for a week at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.25,0:32:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't mind anything。But I mind Golic.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.31,0:32:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,That the way you feel about it？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.48,0:32:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。The guy's crazy and he smells bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.75,0:32:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ain't going out with him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.45,0:32:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got anything to say for yourself？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.87,0:32:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，he's going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.50,0:32:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Golic is just another poor，miserable，suffering son of a bitch，just like you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.55,0:32:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 'Cept he smells worse。- And he's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.80,0:32:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Knock off the shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.34,0:32:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.47,0:32:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear another word about Golic.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.98,0:33:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.25,0:33:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.50,0:34:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,As I thought，Mr。Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.04,0:34:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- As I thought。- You called it，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.64,0:34:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just wanted to，uh，say thanks for what you said at the funeral。It was，uh-
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.81,0:34:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,My friends would have appreciated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.77,0:34:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，well，you don't wanna know me，lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.65,0:34:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a murderer and rapist of women.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.15,0:34:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.49,0:34:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I guess I must make you nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.80,0:34:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you have any faith，sister？- Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.60,0:35:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we've got a lot of faith here。Enough even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.06,0:35:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought women weren't allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.57,0:35:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we've never had any before，
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.87,0:35:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,but we tolerate anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.61,0:35:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Even the intolerable。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.32,0:35:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's just a statement of principle。Nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.08,0:35:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，we've got a good place to wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.50,0:35:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,And until now，no temptation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.51,0:35:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.35,0:35:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're waiting for God to return…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.69,0:35:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,and raise his servants to redemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.61,0:35:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dillon and the rest of the alternative people…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.70,0:36:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,embraced religion，as it were，about five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.37,0:36:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tincture？- I'm on medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.58,0:36:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hardly。- What kind of religion？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.13,0:36:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some sort of apocalyptic，millenarian，Christian fundamentalist，uh-
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.67,0:36:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right。- Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.09,0:36:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Point is，when the company wanted to close the facility down，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.01,0:36:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dillon and the rest of the converts wanted to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.77,0:36:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they were allowed to remain as custodians…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.98,0:36:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,with two minders…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.98,0:36:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,and a medical officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.74,0:36:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,And here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.90,0:36:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did you get this wonderful assignment？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.49,0:36:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you like your new haircut？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.33,0:36:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.35,0:37:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now that I've gone out on a limb for you with Andrews，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.14,0:37:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,damaged my already less-than-perfect relationship with that good man，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.48,0:37:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,and briefed you…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.98,0:37:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,on the humdrum history of Fury 161 ，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.90,0:37:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,can you not tell me what you were looking for in the girl？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.37,0:37:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,You attracted to me？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.49,0:37:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,ln what way？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.75,0:37:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,ln that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.54,0:37:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very direct.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.13,0:37:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been out here a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.14,0:37:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,So have I.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.64,0:38:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yech！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.74,0:38:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Spike。Spike？Spikey！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.91,0:38:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you down there？What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.54,0:39:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really appreciate your affections，
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.05,0:39:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I am aware that they… deflected my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.01,0:39:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the nicest possible way，of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.73,0:39:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're spoiling the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.90,0:39:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.90,0:40:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just want to know why we had to cremate the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.86,0:40:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now that I'm in your cot，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.82,0:40:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,you think I owe you an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.28,0:40:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you owe me an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.08,0:40:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Being in my bed's got nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.71,0:40:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had a terrible dream in hypersleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.71,0:40:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I had to be sure what killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.55,0:40:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，I made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.68,0:40:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.76,0:40:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now I've made another mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.89,0:40:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？What's that？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.89,0:40:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fraternizing with a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.82,0:40:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Physical contact。It's against the rules，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.07,0:40:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Definitely。- When was this？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.28,0:40:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,l think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.03,0:40:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.04,0:41:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have a bar code on the back of your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.55,0:41:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,That does deserve an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.05,0:41:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I don't think now is the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.22,0:41:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。We are rather spoiling things，aren't we？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.77,0:41:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Clemens.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.02,0:41:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mr。Aaron。- Superintendent Andrews would like you to report…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.90,0:41:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,to vent shaft 22 on the second quadrant-now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.74,0:41:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We've had an accident。- Something serious？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.87,0:41:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You could call it that。One of our prisoners has been… diced.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.29,0:41:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.42,0:41:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Official duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.74,0:42:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who was it？- Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.37,0:42:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.46,0:42:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's his boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.63,0:42:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gave him the assignment，sir。He was a wanker.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.51,0:42:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,No apologies，Mr。Aaron。It wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.77,0:42:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，not much to say，is there？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.98,0:42:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Death was instantaneous。- No shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.11,0:42:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I take it he was pulled into the fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.57,0:42:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sudden rush of air，I'd imagine，except-
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.61,0:42:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Almost happened to me once.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.78,0:43:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've told him so many times，「Stay away from the fans.」
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.24,0:43:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody bloody listens.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.25,0:43:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Except the fan was blowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.34,0:43:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's that？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.51,0:43:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to see you in my quarters in 30 minutes，if you'll please，Mr。Clemens.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.81,0:43:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you got any ideas？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.57,0:44:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here you are。You know，wandering around without an escort…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.40,0:44:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,is really gonna piss Superintendent Andrews off.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.32,0:44:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you tell me about your accident？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.74,0:44:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of the prisoners has been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.50,0:44:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？How？Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.92,0:44:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the air shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.54,0:44:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Poor soul backed into a nine-foot fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.21,0:44:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I found something at the accident site，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.63,0:44:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,just a bit away from where it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.14,0:44:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,A mark。A burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.22,0:44:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rather like the one you found on the girl's cryo-tube.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.48,0:45:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.49,0:45:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to help，but I need to know what's going on…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.08,0:45:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,or what you think is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.08,0:45:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,lf you really wanna help，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.17,0:45:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,find me a computer with audio capabilities…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.42,0:45:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,so I can access this flight recorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.63,0:45:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't have anything like that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.88,0:45:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well，what about Bishop？- Bishop？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.13,0:45:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,The droid that crashed with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.72,0:45:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can point you in the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.18,0:45:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.26,0:45:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a previous engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.06,0:45:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,This'll top you up。Golic，don't fidget.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.98,0:45:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's all this shit？It's not properly wrapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.99,0:45:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What the hell does he ever do right？- Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.20,0:45:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's got that down pretty good。- Golic！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.57,0:45:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You light a candle for Murphy。- I'll light a thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.12,0:45:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was special.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.75,0:45:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never complained about me once.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.13,0:46:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.09,0:46:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it true what they say？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.18,0:46:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,His head split into a million pieces？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.64,0:46:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Who's got the matches？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.98,0:46:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sit down，Mr。Clemens。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.03,0:46:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sugar？- Uh，no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.11,0:46:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Milk？- Just a little，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.37,0:46:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Mr。Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.17,0:46:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me，you piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.51,0:46:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,You screw with me one more time，I'll cut you in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.64,0:46:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。I don't think I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.76,0:46:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,At 0700 hours，I received word from the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.89,0:46:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I may point out this is the first high-level communication…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.81,0:46:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,this installation has ever received，to my knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.02,0:47:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,They want this woman looked after.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.03,0:47:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They consider her to be very high priority。- Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.82,0:47:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,l have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.20,0:47:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,But why did you let her out of the infirmary？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.58,0:47:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,This accident with Murphy is what happens…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.83,0:47:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,when one of these dumb sons of a bitches walks around with a hard-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.92,0:47:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a doctor。You're the jailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.38,0:47:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,We both know exactly what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.13,0:47:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sit down。I think it might be better if I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.34,0:47:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I find you… unpleasant to be around.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.14,0:47:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do？Isn't that lovely？Consider this，Mr。Clemens.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.60,0:47:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,How would you like me to explain your sordid history…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.77,0:47:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,to your newfound friend？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.11,0:47:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,For her personal edification，of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.98,0:47:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now sit the hell down.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.16,0:48:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't like you。You're unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.42,0:48:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Insolent。Possibly dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.30,0:48:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You question everything！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.26,0:48:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I didn't need a medical officer，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.80,0:48:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wouldn't let you within light years of this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.14,0:48:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm eternally grateful。- Keep your sarcasms to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.43,0:48:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，is there anything I should know？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.02,0:48:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- About what？- About the woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.36,0:48:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't play with me，Mr。Clemens。You spend every second you can with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.99,0:48:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I have my suspicions not all of your concerns with her are medical.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.87,0:48:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Has she said anything to you-anything about where she's from，what her mission is？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.83,0:48:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell she was doing in an E.E.V.？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.08,0:48:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,She told me she was part of a combat unit that came to grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.96,0:48:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Beyond that，I assume it's all classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.55,0:48:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't pressed her for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.97,0:48:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's all？- That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.09,0:48:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're sure？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.26,0:48:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nothing more？- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.02,0:49:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.84,0:50:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up，you fuckin' bitch！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.30,0:50:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get in there！- Shut up，you bitch！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.76,0:51:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nobody's gonna hear you。- Goddamn it，let go of me！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.02,0:51:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck you！No！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.73,0:51:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold still！Shh！Shh！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.81,0:51:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Goddamn it！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.45,0:51:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,You okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.66,0:51:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Son of a bitch！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.33,0:51:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take off。I gotta reeducate some of the brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.63,0:51:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've gotta discuss some matters of the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.98,0:51:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cigarettes！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.91,0:52:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,So let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.71,0:52:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is like 10 city blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.84,0:52:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How many？- This makes 176.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.35,0:52:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't you chew a little quieter？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.02,0:52:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm trying to figure out how big this compartment is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.27,0:52:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't think with all this goddamn noise you're making.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.19,0:52:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're not supposed to swear。- I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.11,0:52:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now，we've encircled this entire compartment once。- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.61,0:52:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.04,0:52:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the shit is doing that？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.08,0:52:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Swearing。- Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.92,0:52:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right to say 「shit.」 It ain't against God.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.50,0:52:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on with the candles？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.34,0:53:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Must be the wind from one of the vent shafts.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.26,0:53:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Backwash from the closest circulating unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.14,0:53:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if all the candles go out，how the hell we gonna know where we are？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.23,0:53:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody will just have to go back and relight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.00,0:53:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess I'm nominated.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.08,0:53:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch your step，brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.84,0:53:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，who are the comedians？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.68,0:54:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，wait，wait！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.68,0:54:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Quick，grab it。Here。- Help me！Help me！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.64,0:54:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Fuckin' go！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.61,0:54:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，go，go！Quick！Run！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.29,0:54:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gimme that！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.20,0:55:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get this fucking thing off me！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.71,0:55:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，fuck！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.00,0:55:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me go！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.06,0:56:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.44,0:56:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.73,0:56:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，Bishop。How you feeling？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.44,0:56:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,My legs hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.49,0:56:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，listen，I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.78,0:56:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay。I'm just a glorified toaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.45,0:56:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.79,0:56:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like your new haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.16,0:57:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bishop，can you access data on the flight recorder？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.90,0:57:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.15,0:57:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Golic？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.94,0:57:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm home。- What happened on the Sulaco？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.58,0:57:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why were our cryo-tubes ejected？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.29,0:57:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stasis interrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.92,0:57:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire in cryogenic compartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.92,0:57:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Repeat。Fire in cryogenic - What happened？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.47,0:57:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,What started the fire，Bishop？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.10,0:57:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.39,0:58:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,The fire was electrical.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.48,0:58:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,lt was in the subflooring.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.81,0:58:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did the sensors pick up anything moving around on the ship prior to separation？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.48,0:58:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's very dark here，Ripley。I'm not what I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.03,0:58:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just tell me。Does the recorder indicate anything？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.49,0:58:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was there an alien on board？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.45,0:58:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.58,0:58:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it on the Sulaco or did it come with us on the E.E.V.？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.80,0:58:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was with us all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.36,0:58:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does the company know？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.48,0:58:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,The company knows everything that happened on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.78,0:58:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,It all goes into the computer and gets sent back to network.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.24,0:59:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.29,0:59:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hurt。Do me a favor。Disconnect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.67,0:59:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could be reworked，but I'll never be top of the line again.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.84,0:59:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd rather be nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.59,0:59:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're sure？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.84,0:59:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do it for me，Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.57,0:59:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,It wasn't me！I didn't do it！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.57,0:59:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was-It was the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.79,0:59:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Feeds on minds。It was-
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.08,0:59:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nobody can stop it。- What about Boggs and Rains？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.50,0:59:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They got s-slaughtered like pigs。- It wasn't me！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.92,0:59:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It wasn't me！- Stark raving mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.76,0:59:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not saying it was anyone's fault，but he should have been chained up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.51,0:59:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You called it，sir。Mad as a fucking hatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.93,1:00:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep him separated from the rest。I don't want him causing a panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.81,1:00:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clemens，sedate this poor idiot。Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.46,1:00:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not until we know about the brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.56,1:00:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，now。Pull yourself together。Talk to me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.52,1:00:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now，where are Boggs and Rains？- It wasn't me！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.49,1:00:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hopeless。You're not gonna get anything out of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.49,1:00:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It wasn't me。- We'll have to send out a search team.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.41,1:00:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we'll have to assume there's a very good chance…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.83,1:00:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,this simple bastard has murdered them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.04,1:00:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，you don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.42,1:00:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's never lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.25,1:00:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's crazy，he's a fool，but he's not a liar.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.55,1:00:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.97,1:00:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk to him about this-this dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.18,1:00:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It was a dragon。- You're not talking to anyone，Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.23,1:00:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in your opinion，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.19,1:00:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,because you are not in full possession of the facts.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.40,1:00:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,This man is a convicted multiple murderer，known for particularly brutal crimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.03,1:00:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't that right，Mr。Dillon？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.78,1:01:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。That part's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.99,1:01:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then I'll talk to you。It's important.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.58,1:01:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I have finished with my official duties，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.08,1:01:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will be quite pleased to have a little chat，yes？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.59,1:01:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me see if I have this correct，Lieutenant。It's an eight-foot creature of some kind，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.05,1:01:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,with acid for blood，and it arrived on your spaceship.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.39,1:01:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,It kills on sight and is generally unpleasant.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.98,1:01:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，of course，you expect me to accept all this on your word.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.60,1:01:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I don't expect anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.07,1:01:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Quite a story，Mr。Aaron。- Right，sir。It's a beauty.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.99,1:01:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Never heard anything quite like it，sir。- Expect not.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.03,1:01:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me，Lieutenant，what would you suggest we do？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.49,1:01:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，what kind of weapons have you got？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.00,1:01:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.08,1:01:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not a good idea to allow prisoners access to firearms.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.63,1:01:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,What keeps them from killing you？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.50,1:01:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fear。There's no way to escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.55,1:02:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,With the arrival of the next supply ship，the company would eliminate them.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.59,1:02:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a maximum security prison，
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.97,1:02:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you have no weapons of any kind？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.98,1:02:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have some carving knives in the abattoir。A few more in the mess hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.86,1:02:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some fire axes scattered about the place。Nothing terribly formidable.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.36,1:02:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's all？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.74,1:02:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're on the honor system.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.50,1:02:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Then we're fucked。- No，you're fucked.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.79,1:02:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Confined to the infirmary。Quarantined.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.25,1:02:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Aaron will escort you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.05,1:02:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you'll be safe from any large，nasty beast while you're there，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.35,1:02:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，that's a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.52,1:02:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's all report to the mess hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.27,1:03:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Superintendent Andrews wants a meeting。Mess hall，right away，people.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.36,1:03:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't there any way off of this place？Some way to escape？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.53,1:03:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Supply ship comes every six months.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.37,1:03:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And that's it？- Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.45,1:03:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.37,1:03:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are sending somebody to pick you up quite soon，I gather.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.71,1:03:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really.What's 「soon」？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.59,1:03:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。Nobody's ever been in a hurry to get here before.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.93,1:03:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you want to tell me what you and Andrews talked about？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.93,1:03:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.31,1:03:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll just say I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.40,1:03:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a bit uncharitable.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.53,1:03:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are you feeling？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.58,1:03:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not so hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.79,1:03:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sore throat.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.79,1:04:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sick to my stomach。Pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.79,1:04:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，that's understandable given the circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.76,1:04:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should give you one of my special cocktails.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.34,1:04:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know why everybody blames everybody for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.22,1:04:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody's persect，only human.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.85,1:04:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as a perfect human.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.23,1:04:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,In an insane world，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.40,1:04:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,a sane man…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.94,1:04:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,must… appear… insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.49,1:04:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's very profound，Golic。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.83,1:04:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You married？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.79,1:04:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Me？- You should get married，have kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.46,1:04:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pretty girl。I used to know lots of 'em back home.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.76,1:04:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,They used to like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.10,1:04:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,For a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.15,1:05:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna die too.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.16,1:05:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you？- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.95,1:05:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Married.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.29,1:05:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.79,1:05:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just curious。- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.96,1:05:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How about leveling with me？- Could you be more specific？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.30,1:05:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I asked how you got assigned here，you avoided the question.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.01,1:05:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then when I asked about the prison I.D。tattooed on the back of your head，
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.31,1:05:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,you ducked me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.15,1:05:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a long，sad story…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.57,1:05:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,and more than a little melodramatic.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.99,1:05:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.36,1:05:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.58,1:06:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,After my student years，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.04,1:06:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,despite the fact that I had become…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.09,1:06:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,secretly addicted to morphine，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.59,1:06:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was considered to be most promising，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.92,1:06:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,a man with a future.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.39,1:06:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,And during my first residency，I did a 36-hour stretch on an E.R.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.94,1:06:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，I went out and I got more than a little drunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.56,1:06:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then I got called back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.82,1:06:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boiler had blown on a fuel plant，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.07,1:06:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,and there were 30 casualties.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.24,1:06:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,And 11 of them died.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.66,1:06:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not as a result of the accident…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.91,1:06:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,but because I prescribed the wrong dosage of painkiller.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.50,1:06:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got seven years in prison and my license reduced to a 3-C.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.46,1:06:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,At least I got off the morphine.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.88,1:06:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.80,1:06:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,l think I was let off lightly.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.06,1:07:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you serve your time here？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.14,1:07:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got to know this motley crew quite well.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.15,1:07:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,So when they stayed，I stayed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.44,1:07:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody else would employ me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.20,1:07:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，do you still trust me with a needle？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.96,1:08:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.88,1:09:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give us strength，O Lord，to endure.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.68,1:09:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,We recognize that we are poor sinners in the hands of an angry God.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.31,1:09:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let the circle be unbroken until the day。Amen.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.77,1:09:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Amen。- What the fuck is happening here？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.65,1:09:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck is this bullshit that's comin' down？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.15,1:09:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got murder。We got rape。We got brothers in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.24,1:09:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want no more bullshit around here！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.70,1:09:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，we got problems，we stand together.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.50,1:09:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Thank you，Mr。Dillon。All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.42,1:09:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once again，this is rumor control.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.63,1:09:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here are the facts.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.26,1:09:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,At 0800 hours，prisoner Murphy，
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.01,1:09:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,through carelessness on his part，
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.93,1:09:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,was found dead in vent shaft 17.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.85,1:09:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,He seems to have been sucked into a ventilator fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.86,1:09:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,At about 21 hours，
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.69,1:10:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,prisoner Golic reappeared in a deranged state.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.90,1:10:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Prisoners Boggs and Rains are missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.28,1:10:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,There seems to be a good chance that they have met with foul play…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.04,1:10:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,at the hands of prisoner Golic.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.25,1:10:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to organize and send out a search party.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.12,1:10:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Volunteers will be appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.38,1:10:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it's fair to say that our smoothly running facility…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.64,1:10:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,has suddenly developed a few problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.56,1:10:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can only hope we are able to all pull together over the next few days…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.52,1:10:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,until the rescue team arrives for Lieutenant Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.82,1:10:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's here！It got Clemens！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.86,1:10:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stop this raving at once！Stop it！- I'm telling you，it's here！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.66,1:10:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aaron，get that foolish woman back to the infirmary！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.87,1:10:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move it！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.25,1:10:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out of my way！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.13,1:11:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.89,1:11:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,We give you thanks，O Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.02,1:11:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your wrath has come，and the time is near for us to be judged.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.06,1:11:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,The apocalypse is upon us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.15,1:11:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let us be ready。Let your mercy be just.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.87,1:11:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It was massive。- Amen！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.62,1:11:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And fast。- I was there。I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.24,1:11:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck do we do now？Who's in fucking charge？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.59,1:11:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Organize。We gotta organize，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.17,1:11:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Well，I guess I'm next in line.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.97,1:11:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 85's gonna be in charge。Jesus，give us a break！- Don't call me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.64,1:11:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，look。There's no way I can replace Andrews.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.10,1:11:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was a good man。I know you guys didn't appreciate him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.89,1:11:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aaron，we don't want to hear that shit now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.15,1:12:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，sister，what about you？You're an officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.27,1:12:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about showing us a little leadership？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.28,1:12:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forget fucking Shirley Temple。You take charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.32,1:12:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right。- You run things here anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.66,1:12:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No fuckin' way。I'm not the officer type.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.74,1:12:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just take care of my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.00,1:12:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，what does this fucking beast want？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.34,1:12:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this mother gonna try for us all？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.63,1:12:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- Well，ain't that sweet？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.30,1:12:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,So how are we gonna stop it？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.64,1:12:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We have no weapons。Is that correct？- Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.52,1:12:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't seen one exactly like this before.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.31,1:12:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Moves differently.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.86,1:12:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,But the others were afraid of fire-
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.45,1:12:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,not much else.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.74,1:12:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can we seal off this area？- No chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.00,1:12:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,The installation's 10 miles square.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.29,1:13:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There's 600 air ducts running to the surface。- What about video？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.62,1:13:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see these closed-circuit monitors everywhere。We could try to find it that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.42,1:13:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,The video system hasn't worked in years。Nothing much works here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.63,1:13:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got a lot of technology，no way to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.93,1:13:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What 85 is trying to tell you is… - Don't call me that！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.43,1:13:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,we ain't got no entertainment center，no climate control，
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.60,1:13:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,no video system，no surveillance，
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.27,1:13:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,no freezers，no fucking ice cream，
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.86,1:13:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,no rubbers，no women，no guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.73,1:13:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,All we got here is shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.90,1:13:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，what the hell are we even talking to her for？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.70,1:13:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's the one that brought the fucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.20,1:13:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't we just get her head and shove it through the fucking wall？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.16,1:13:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,That sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.50,1:13:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Morse.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.42,1:13:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you shut the fuck up？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.51,1:13:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.52,1:14:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。What are we going to do？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.99,1:14:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's this？Um，
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.54,1:14:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,that leads from the mess hall to the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.70,1:14:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a ventilation shaft.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.79,1:14:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then we go in there，flush it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.21,1:14:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Hey，look，there's miles and miles of tunnel through there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.22,1:14:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,It won't go far.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.26,1:14:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll nest in this area.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.64,1:14:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right around…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.64,1:14:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Here。- How do you know that？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.40,1:14:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's like a lion.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.02,1:14:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,It sticks close to the zebras.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.32,1:14:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Zebras？Oh，right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.82,1:14:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，look。Running around down here in the dark-Are you kidding？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.57,1:14:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once you get out of this main shaft，there's no overheads.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.07,1:15:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't we have flashlights？- We got thousands of 'em，but no batteries.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.33,1:15:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I told you，nothing works。- Torches？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.21,1:15:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do we have the capacity to make fire？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.29,1:15:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Most humans have enjoyed that privilege since the Stone Age.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.67,1:15:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,No need to be sarcastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.68,1:15:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never been used。They were gonna dump a lot of nuclear crap in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.68,1:15:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never got around to it。It's clean as a whistle inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.89,1:15:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,This the only way in or out？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.44,1:15:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right。Walls are six feet thick，solid steel.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.27,1:15:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really knew how to build these babies.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.77,1:15:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're saying we get something in there，
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.78,1:15:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,there's no way it can get out？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.02,1:15:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right。No fucking way.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.54,1:15:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is where we keep it。I forget what the stuff's called.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.00,1:15:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Quinitricetyline。- I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.59,1:15:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。I've got to get these section arrangements organized with Dillon…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.93,1:15:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,for the paintbrush，uh-
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.64,1:16:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So，um - David.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.14,1:16:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。You can get these drums organized。- Right，85.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.27,1:16:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，uh，don't call me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.15,1:16:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's this 「85」 thing？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.15,1:16:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Couple of us sneaked a look at his personnel file the day he arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.53,1:16:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's his I.Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.67,1:16:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saw a drum of this stuff…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.88,1:16:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,fall into a beachhead bunker once.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.13,1:16:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,The blast put a tug in dry dock for 17 weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.67,1:16:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great stuff！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.07,1:16:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.20,1:16:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to burn it down and out of the pipes，
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.70,1:16:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,force it in here，slam the door…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.96,1:16:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- and trap its ass？- Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.67,1:16:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you want help from us y-chromo boys，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.74,1:16:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got something better to do？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.70,1:17:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why should we put our ass on the line for you？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.57,1:17:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your ass is already on the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.83,1:17:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only question is…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.54,1:17:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,what are you gonna do about it？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.76,1:17:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.85,1:17:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's only one of these fucking batteries in 2，000 that works.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.43,1:17:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，it could have been a lot worse。Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.73,1:17:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,We might have got the paintbrush detail.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.94,1:17:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，this stuff stinks.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.62,1:17:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This shit smells awful。- Then don't breathe the fucking fumes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.59,1:17:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm in a fucking pipe with it。- How can I keep from breathing it！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.63,1:18:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，don't breathe too hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.01,1:18:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You'll get high。- That's good for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.94,1:18:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you miss Doc，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.90,1:18:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What makes you say that？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.49,1:18:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you two got real close.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.45,1:18:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess you've been looking through some keyholes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.45,1:18:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I thought。Oh！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.59,1:18:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You okay？- Yeah。l'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.38,1:18:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever you say，but，uh，you don't look okay to me，sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.64,1:18:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,l'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.19,1:18:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate this place。I hate this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.15,1:19:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.20,1:19:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's definitely something in here with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.12,1:19:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Don't light the fire until I give the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.99,1:19:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.66,1:19:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got it？Can you remember that？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.38,1:19:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.56,1:20:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Buh-
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.78,1:20:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait for the fucking signal！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.24,1:20:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.00,1:20:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，come on！We gotta find the sprinklers！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.55,1:20:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！We gotta help these guys！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.89,1:20:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Move！Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.89,1:21:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go to the waste dump。Don't open the doors！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.33,1:22:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，God！- It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.29,1:22:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right。You're gonna be all right。We got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.72,1:22:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire's out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.56,1:22:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Junior！Junior！Get those sprinklers and turn them on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.23,1:22:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,We gotta get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.12,1:22:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。We're walking you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.08,1:22:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Junior！Behind you！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.55,1:22:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open the door！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.51,1:22:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.19,1:23:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.15,1:23:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come and get me，fucker！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.49,1:24:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even for those who have fallen，
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.74,1:24:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,this is a time of rejoicing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.92,1:24:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,We salute their courage.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.30,1:24:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,They will live forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.39,1:25:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those that are dead are not dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.97,1:25:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,They have moved up.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.85,1:25:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,They have moved to a higher place.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.61,1:25:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crazy bastards.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.40,1:25:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Andrews used to call them Dillon's God Squad。Keeps 'em out of mischief.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.03,1:25:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're not the religious type。- Me？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.87,1:25:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit，no。I've got a job.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.87,1:25:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，uh-
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.25,1:25:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Figure the rescue team gets here in four，five days-
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.29,1:25:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,six，tops.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.50,1:25:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,They open the door，go in there with smart guns and kill it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.05,1:25:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What have you heard from them？- Nothing much.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.97,1:25:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got a message received.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.56,1:25:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Later，we got something that said you were top priority.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.36,1:25:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,They don't cut us in on much.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.61,1:25:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're the ass end of the totem pole out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.90,1:26:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if they don't want to kill it？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.24,1:26:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Take it back？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.45,1:26:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're not lunatics，you know？Gotta kill it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.79,1:26:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.67,1:26:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morse，please，cut me loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.80,1:26:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,No fucking way.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.64,1:26:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，man。It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.43,1:26:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.47,1:26:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。I haven't done nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.77,1:26:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just don't talk to me。- Please，what did I do？Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.40,1:26:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what I'm gonna do。I'm gonna sit here and guard your ass like l'm supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.03,1:26:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't need any fucking trouble with Dillon.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.74,1:26:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,All I did was tell 'em about the dragon，what it did to Boggs and Rains.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.66,1:26:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't lie。You saw it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.37,1:26:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuckin' 「A」 I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.33,1:26:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.83,1:26:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,If this gets in here，I'm dead。I can't run.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.92,1:27:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not going to get in here。We got it trapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.72,1:27:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,So what's the big deal？Come on。Let me loose，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.68,1:27:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't I always give you cigarettes first？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.48,1:27:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aren't I your friend？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.52,1:27:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you，Morse.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.65,1:27:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why not？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.99,1:27:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,But behave yourself。No fucking around…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.58,1:27:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,or I'll get nothing but shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.26,1:27:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So where they got it？- In the waste tank.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.80,1:27:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got that sucker nailed。I mean，tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.56,1:27:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gotta see it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.19,1:27:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.07,1:28:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,No more cigarettes for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.62,1:28:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。We got the first part。Now what do we say？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.87,1:28:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell them we trapped it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.33,1:28:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do we call it？- A xenomorph.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.55,1:28:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.55,1:28:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you spell it？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.78,1:28:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，wait a minute。We can't kill it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.53,1:28:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We don't have any weapons，right？- Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.37,1:28:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,See？That's all they ever tell us。Treat us like shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.69,1:29:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Off and on me now？- What the hell you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.82,1:29:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Talk to me，the beast.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.49,1:29:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't go in there，dickhead。The big mothersucker will eat you alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.25,1:29:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.92,1:29:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，sorry，sorry，sorry，sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.20,1:30:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me what to do next.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.36,1:30:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，you're telling me they're coming to take this thing away？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.23,1:30:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，they're gonna try。They don't wanna kill it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.61,1:30:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,We gotta figure out a way to do it before they come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.20,1:30:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do we have to kill it？You just said the company's coming for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.33,1:31:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right。They wanna take it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.46,1:31:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Some sort of weapon。- Yeah，what's wrong with that？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.33,1:31:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,They can't control it。They don't understand。It'll kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.00,1:31:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like I said，what's wrong with that？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.92,1:31:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing's wrong with that… except a lot of innocent people will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.01,1:31:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you were a religious man.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.10,1:31:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't understand，do you？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.60,1:31:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,That world out there doesn't exist for us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.90,1:31:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got our own little world out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.74,1:31:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It ain't much，but it's ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.49,1:31:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,So fuck everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.37,1:31:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Fuck them.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.59,1:31:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，Dillon？- Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.92,1:31:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，Dillon，we got a teeny-weeny problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.28,1:32:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fucking great！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.57,1:32:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miserable，crazy son of a bitch let him loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.28,1:32:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got what he fucking deserved.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.29,1:32:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，now what are we gonna do？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.29,1:32:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Andrews was right。Should've kept the shithead chained up.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.59,1:32:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,You okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.05,1:32:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Piss on her。The fucking thing's loose out there。What are we gonna do？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.30,1:32:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,l just said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.01,1:32:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you're the dumb prick that let Golic out。You miserable little shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.14,1:32:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Cut that shit out.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.98,1:32:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell your fucking bozo to shape up！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.27,1:32:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What do you think？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.65,1:32:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I have to get to the E.E.V.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.90,1:33:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why？What's up？- I just have to use the neuroscanner.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.66,1:33:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You don't look so good。- Who gives a shit how she looks？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.87,1:33:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are we gonna do？- Want a smack in the mouth，you stupid wanker？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.66,1:33:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut the fuck up and stop causing panic！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.67,1:33:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Panic-You're so fucking stupid，you couldn't spell it。Don't talk to me about panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.25,1:33:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We ought to panic！We're fucking screwed！- Whose fault is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.71,1:33:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Now shut up，both of you！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.76,1:33:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.15,1:33:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well，I'm out of ideas！- Oh，surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.70,1:33:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What about outside？- Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.29,1:33:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sun don't come up for another two days。It's 40 below zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.71,1:33:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rescue team's 10 hours away。So that makes a lot of sense！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.42,1:33:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wonderful。You just want us to stay here and let this thing have us for lunch！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.84,1:33:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to get everybody that's still left together.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.55,1:34:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get 'em into the assembly hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.89,1:34:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.22,1:34:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where'd she go？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.96,1:34:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Need any help？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.92,1:34:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't mean to scare you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.93,1:34:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be wandering around alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.05,1:34:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do me a favor and run this keyboard，will you？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.05,1:34:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.19,1:35:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do I do？- Hit 「B」 or 「C.」
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.48,1:35:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's 「C」？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.28,1:35:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「Display biofunctions.」 - That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.78,1:35:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，we're hot。Now what？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.53,1:35:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let it run a cycle.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.50,1:35:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's real fuzzy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.41,1:35:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hit 「enhancement.」
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.94,1:35:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.85,1:35:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know how to read this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.53,1:35:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hemorrhaging will show as a dark patch.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.70,1:36:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look for…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.37,1:36:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,hairline fractures through the base of the skull.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.33,1:36:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Little white lines.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.72,1:36:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.43,1:36:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you've got one inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.27,1:36:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.86,1:36:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,What does it look like？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.82,1:36:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Horrible。- I have to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.37,1:36:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Freeze it。- You don't want to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.37,1:36:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freeze it！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.77,1:37:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.59,1:37:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。The fucking thing is loose。It's out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.97,1:37:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,A rescue team is on its way with guns and shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.43,1:37:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now there isn't any place that's real safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.35,1:37:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we stay here，in the assembly hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.39,1:37:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,This place never had any fucking air conditioning.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.56,1:37:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,If it comes in，it's gotta be through one of these doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.86,1:37:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now we post a guard to let us know if it's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.82,1:37:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the meantime，you lay low，be ready and stay right…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.34,1:37:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,in case your time comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.56,1:37:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you start bullshitting，Dillon.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.64,1:37:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna be trapped in here like rats.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.73,1:38:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a weapon？You got a blade？Then you take it out and you fucking use it！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.57,1:38:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，right。So you think we're gonna stab this mothersucker to death？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.40,1:38:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I don't think shit！Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.16,1:38:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll hurt it before it takes you out，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.16,1:38:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't that something？Any of you got any better ideas？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.92,1:38:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'll tell you，until the rescue team gets here，we're fucked！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.01,1:38:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you better get prepared.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.35,1:38:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I ain't staying here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.56,1:38:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，then，suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.53,1:38:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.83,1:39:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Furnace。- Yeah。Let's make it to the furnace.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.84,1:39:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.17,1:39:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.84,1:39:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuckin' 「A.」
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.01,1:39:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fuckin' 「A.」 - Too fuckin' right it's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.41,1:39:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's up。What do you want to say？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.58,1:39:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell them the whole place has gone toxic.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.50,1:39:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you kidding？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.29,1:39:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then they won't come here。The rescue team will turn back.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.88,1:39:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。I know。- What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.51,1:39:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our only hope is that they kill this fucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.43,1:39:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,And maybe they can do something for you。I don't know，freeze you-
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.76,1:40:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,They can do an operation。They've got the technology.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.18,1:40:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,If this organism gets off the planet，it'll kill everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.06,1:40:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,The company doesn't care about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.44,1:40:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,They just want it for their bioweapons division，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.48,1:40:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,So we can't let them come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.28,1:40:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.45,1:40:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I'm sorry you've got this thing inside you，but l'm getting rescued.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.29,1:40:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't give a shit about these stupid prisoners，but l've got a wife，a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.79,1:40:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll go home on the next rotation！- I know。This is hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.88,1:40:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna send this message。I need that fucking code.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.63,1:40:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，babe。It's classified.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.72,1:40:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，you stupid little shit！This has got to be done，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.64,1:40:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There are no alternatives！- No way！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.14,1:40:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not getting it！No fucking way！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.73,1:40:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，it's nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.68,1:40:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Understand？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.57,1:40:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.99,1:41:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.00,1:41:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you got any ideas？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.46,1:41:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,It won't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.18,1:41:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm carrying the new queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.68,1:41:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,It won't kill its future.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.98,1:41:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You really wanna bet this thing's that smart？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.85,1:41:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll go find it。See how smart it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.48,1:41:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're gonna go and look for it？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.86,1:41:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a pretty good idea of where it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.53,1:41:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just down there… in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.62,1:41:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,This whole place is a basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.25,1:41:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a metaphor。Wanna come？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.92,1:42:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.47,1:43:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you when I need you？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.00,1:43:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.47,1:44:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,l'm part of the family.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.49,1:45:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've been in my life so long，
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.62,1:45:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't remember anything else.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.42,1:45:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now do something for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.38,1:45:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.42,1:45:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just-
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.30,1:45:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just do what you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.39,1:46:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It won't kill me。- What are you doing out here？You're supposed to be laying low.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.35,1:46:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have one inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.02,1:46:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Big one won't kill its own.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.77,1:46:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you talking about？- I just saw it，
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.99,1:46:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.74,1:46:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I stood right next to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.20,1:46:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could've been lunch，but it wouldn't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.29,1:46:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It ran away.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.96,1:46:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,It knows I'm carrying its future.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.29,1:46:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aw，bullshit。How do you know that thing's inside you？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.55,1:46:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saw it… on the CAT scan.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.22,1:46:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a queen-an egg layer.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.39,1:46:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It can make thousands more like the one we've got here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.47,1:47:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still sounds like bullshit to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.27,1:47:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,If that thing's inside you，how'd it get there？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.43,1:47:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.53,1:47:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I was in hypersleep，I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.03,1:47:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,l was violated.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.99,1:47:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now I get to be the mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.12,1:47:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't have much time，
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.88,1:47:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I can't do what I should.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.67,1:47:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.22,1:47:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.35,1:47:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What the fuck are you talking about？- I'm dead anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.06,1:47:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't survive it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.73,1:47:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,But the one inside of me can generate thousands more，
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.49,1:47:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,can wipe out the whole universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.36,1:47:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,lt has to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.95,1:47:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,So somebody's gotta kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.00,1:48:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you up to it？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.08,1:48:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.60,1:48:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,No speeches.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.86,1:48:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,No prayers.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.48,1:49:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's going on？- I don't like losing a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.65,1:49:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not to nobody，not to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.98,1:49:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck。That damn thing out there has already killed half my men，
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.53,1:49:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,got the other half scared shitless.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.45,1:49:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,As long as it's alive，sister，you're not gonna save any universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.62,1:49:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You said you were gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.33,1:49:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You fucking coward！- I want that thing！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.28,1:49:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to get this thing，and I need you to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.87,1:49:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if it won't kill you，then maybe that helps us fight it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.16,1:49:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Otherwise，fuck you！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.17,1:49:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go kill yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.17,1:49:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dillon.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.93,1:49:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,We waste this thing，
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.60,1:49:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- then you take care of me。- No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.06,1:49:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quick，easy and painless.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.32,1:50:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.74,1:50:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You die sitting here on your ass，or you die out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.74,1:50:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,At least we take a shot。We owe it one.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.41,1:50:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's fucked us up。Maybe we can get even for the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.13,1:50:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now how do you want it？- What the fuck are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.92,1:50:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm talkin' about killing that big motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.63,1:50:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold it，hold it。The rescue team's on its way.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.97,1:50:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,We could just sit this out.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.30,1:50:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Rescue team for whom？- For us.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.98,1:50:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,They just want the beast。You know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.15,1:50:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn what they want.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.90,1:50:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're not gonna pick us off one by one，are they？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.50,1:50:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.25,1:50:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。They're gonna take us home.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.59,1:50:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're not gonna take us home.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.96,1:50:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still doesn't mean we should go out and fight it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.96,1:50:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jesus Christ！Give us a break！- You guys have got to be fucking nuts！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.09,1:50:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Look，I've got a wife and a kid。- Nobody gives a shit about you，85.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.81,1:50:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not one of us。You're not a believer.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.39,1:51:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're a fucking company man！- Yeah，okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.14,1:51:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I'm a company man and not a fucking criminal.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.81,1:51:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You keep telling me how dumb I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.40,1:51:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I'm smart enough not to have a life sentence on this rock！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.69,1:51:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fuck you！- Piss off，85！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.61,1:51:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，and I'm smart enough to wait for some firepower to show up before we fight this thing！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.28,1:51:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，Morse？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.03,1:51:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Okay。Just sit here on your asses。Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.83,1:51:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about if I sit here on my ass？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.71,1:51:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,No problem。Oh，I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.25,1:51:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the guy that's made a deal with God…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.29,1:51:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,to live forever，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.01,1:51:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,And all the rest of you pussies can sit it out too.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.38,1:51:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me and her'll do all the fighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.55,1:51:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。But I want the same thing as you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.64,1:51:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to see it dead。I hate the fucker！It killed my mates too！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.77,1:51:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why the fuck can't we wait for the company and have some guns on our side？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.40,1:51:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why do we have to go on some fucking suicide run？- Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.07,1:51:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because they won't kill it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.74,1:51:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,They might kill you just for having seen it。But they're not gonna kill it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.37,1:52:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is crazy！That is horseshit！They will not kill us！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.01,1:52:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,When they first heard about this thing，
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.14,1:52:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,it was 「crew expendable.」
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.52,1:52:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,The next time they sent in marines。They were expendable too.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.32,1:52:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,What makes you think they're gonna care about a bunch of lifers…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.24,1:52:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,who found God at the ass end of space？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.24,1:52:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You really think they're going to let you…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.66,1:52:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,interfere with their plans for this thing？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.08,1:52:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,They think we're-we're crud.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.75,1:52:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they don't give a fuck about one friend of yours…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.17,1:52:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,that's-that's died.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.46,1:52:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not one.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.30,1:52:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you got some sort of plan？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.43,1:52:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a lead works，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.31,1:52:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,All we got to do is lure the fucking beast into the mold，
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.44,1:52:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,drown it in hot lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.73,1:52:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。So how do we do that？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.94,1:53:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。What are we gonna use for bait？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.58,1:53:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，fuck！- We're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.46,1:53:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only question is when.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.46,1:53:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is as good a place as any…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.17,1:53:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,to take your first steps to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.43,1:53:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only question is how you check out.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.10,1:53:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you want it on your feet…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.14,1:53:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,or on your fucking knees，begging？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.02,1:53:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ain't much for begging.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.61,1:53:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody ever gave me nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.53,1:53:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I say fuck that thing！Let's fight it！
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.28,1:53:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck it！Let's go for it！
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.79,1:53:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's kick its fucking ass。- What if it runs at us？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.63,1:54:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a fucking good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.72,1:54:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Channel 「A，」 Door 1 open.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.80,1:54:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,When was the last time you used this place？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.14,1:54:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,We fired it up five，six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.48,1:54:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sure the piston's gonna work？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.19,1:54:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's nothing for sure in this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.12,1:54:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,We trap it here first，then you pull the lever，start the piston.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.62,1:54:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then the piston's gonna push the mothersucker right into the mold.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.21,1:54:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then one of the guys will pour the lead。End of his ass。End of story.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.00,1:54:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What if somebody screws it up？- We're fucked。You got one chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.88,1:54:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,One shot at it。That's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.76,1:54:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll never have time to reset it。Now remember，when you pull the lever，
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.35,1:54:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,for a few seconds you're gonna be trapped in here with that fuckin' thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.68,1:54:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you guys don't drop the ball，I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.02,1:54:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you just better be right about that thing not wanting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.02,1:54:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because if it wants out，that's how it's gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.07,1:54:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Through that alcove，through you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.86,1:55:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where are you gonna be？- I'll be around.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.45,1:55:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What about the others？Where are they？- Praying.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.21,1:55:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You believe in this heaven shit？Eh？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.09,1:55:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.05,1:55:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck it，though。What else have we got to believe in？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.01,1:55:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say that for fucking sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.22,1:55:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well-Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.02,1:55:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.37,1:55:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Silence！I can't hear-
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.76,1:56:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's launch this thing！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.27,1:56:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Channel 「B，」 Door 7.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.61,1:56:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know about this shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.03,1:56:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，guys！My door ain't working！- What the fuck's he saying？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.78,1:56:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think we'd better rethink this thing！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.71,1:56:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did anybody hear anything？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.80,1:56:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come and get me，you fucker！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.39,1:56:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's behind me！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.98,1:57:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's starting。- Still behind me！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.15,1:57:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's in Channel 「B」！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.86,1:57:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still coming！Shut the doors！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.45,1:57:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Must be heading over to Channel 「A」！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.91,1:57:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,This thing is really pissed off！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.62,1:57:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did you say 「B」？- No，「E」！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.17,1:57:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But you said we should stay here！- Move your fucking ass！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.67,1:57:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morse？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.13,1:57:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.65,1:57:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I found Vincent！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.53,1:57:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo！Hey，fuckface！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.70,1:57:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come and get me！Take your best shot！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.17,1:58:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin，where are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.38,1:58:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,A-7 closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.93,1:58:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open the east wing。Door B-7 safe！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.24,1:58:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You cool？- Yeah！Okay。Over to 「E，」 everybody！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.61,1:58:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where the fuck is 「E」？- This way！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.95,1:58:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Troy。Troy？Troy，help 'em！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.83,1:58:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did I get here？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.59,1:58:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where the hell are they going？What about the plan？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.26,1:58:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Look，you're immune，they're not。- So what are we doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.35,1:58:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Improvising！- We're improvising.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.89,1:58:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.83,1:59:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here。Here，kitty，kitty，kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.12,1:59:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，kitty，kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.50,1:59:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.83,1:59:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my-You bastard！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.51,1:59:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's coming！It's coming，Dillon！Geez，it's coming！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.26,1:59:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's comin' after us！Shut the fucking doors！That was the plan！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.52,1:59:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Geez，it's on the fucking ceiling！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.94,1:59:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dillon！Anybody！This is not a drill！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.31,1:59:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin！Gregor！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.19,1:59:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where the fuck are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.41,1:59:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now I'm back in 「A」！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.87,2:00:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.55,2:00:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Door 3，「F」 Channel closed！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.51,2:00:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.14,2:00:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.60,2:00:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck are you doing？What？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.35,2:00:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't hold it like that。Hold it like this。What the fuck-
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.27,2:00:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll fucking kill someone，you fucking moron！Ow！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.78,2:00:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morse！Kevin！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.57,2:00:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gregor！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.41,2:00:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,All they have to do is run down the damn corridor.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.29,2:00:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.38,2:00:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where the hell is it？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.79,2:01:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's coming。Aw，Jesus！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.97,2:01:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Don't start the piston！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.72,2:01:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！We have to trap it！No！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.39,2:01:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！What are you doing？It's gone！No！No.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.31,2:01:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.19,2:01:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.61,2:01:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.98,2:02:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the heck？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.86,2:02:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.49,2:02:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin！Don't struggle！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.11,2:02:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't move！No！Don't struggle！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.62,2:02:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Come on，Kevin。Come on！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.49,2:02:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come on！Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.83,2:02:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The doors。- It's coming！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.42,2:02:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take the piston！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.88,2:02:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got ya。It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.88,2:03:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay。I got ya。It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.59,2:03:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right，Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.97,2:03:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.35,2:03:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.73,2:03:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave him.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.52,2:03:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave him。He's dead。Lure it in.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.96,2:03:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit。How much time？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.21,2:03:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not sure。Four or five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.09,2:03:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we've got to get it back in here before the piston seals this place off.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.22,2:03:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，let's move it！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.41,2:04:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Help me！- Jude！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.50,2:04:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dillon！Help me，Dillon！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.67,2:04:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's coming at me！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.13,2:04:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't look back，Jude！Run as fast as you fucking can！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.35,2:04:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.68,2:04:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,God！Please！Help！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.03,2:04:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Channel 「C，」 Door 3 closed.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.58,2:05:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ！Thank God you're here.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.67,2:05:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Warder Aaron，sir。1-3-7-5-1-2.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.17,2:05:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Not many of us left，sir。- Where is Lieutenant Ripley？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.14,2:05:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is she still alive？- If she's alive，she's in the furnace.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.56,2:05:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's in the lead works with the beast.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.73,2:05:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wouldn't wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.41,2:05:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jesus Christ。- You fucker。Scared me shitless！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.91,2:05:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you were the fucking beast。You fuck！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:45.59,2:05:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wanker！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.45,2:06:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move。Come on，you bastard！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.33,2:06:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come on，get out of there！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.38,2:06:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.47,2:06:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley，we're running out of time！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.18,2:06:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley，where are you？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.20,2:06:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:58.77,2:07:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm over here
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.30,2:07:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Get out of there！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.38,2:07:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck is wrong with you？No！No！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.34,2:07:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let it go！Let it go！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.76,2:07:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes！It's working！- Scream！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.68,2:07:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- To the piston！- Scream！Let it follow us.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.52,2:07:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！We got to get it in front of the piston.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.69,2:07:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back there。It's following us！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.07,2:07:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Motherfucker！Come on！Come and get us！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.65,2:07:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.65,2:07:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Up to the door！Close it！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.03,2:07:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，motherfucker！Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.83,2:07:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Get the door！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.08,2:07:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get the door！- Morse！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.17,2:07:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！Shut it！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.88,2:07:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut it，Morse！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.09,2:07:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morse，shut that door！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.92,2:07:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now！- Shut the fucking door！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.22,2:07:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going for the lead！
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.38,2:08:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go！Now！- What about you？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.89,2:08:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm staying。- Bullshit！There's gonna be 10 tons of hot lead in there！
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.35,2:08:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I keep telling you，I want to die！- We got a deal！
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.52,2:08:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember？It dies first，then you！
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.15,2:08:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna move without you！Now get going！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.71,2:09:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dillon！- I've got to hold it here.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.54,2:09:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What about me？- God will take care of you now，sister！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.88,2:09:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.88,2:09:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pour the lead.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.10,2:09:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.39,2:09:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on！Pour it，Ripley！Go on！Damn it！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:31.98,2:09:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pour that lead，Ripley！Pour it now！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.53,2:09:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come on！That's all you've got？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.74,2:09:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that all that you fight，motherfucker！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.16,2:09:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morse！Morse，over here！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.49,2:09:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ripley！- Pour the lead！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.29,2:09:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pour the lead！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.75,2:09:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pour it！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.77,2:10:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate bugs！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.92,2:11:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley！It's burning hot！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.80,2:11:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hit the sprinklers！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.34,2:11:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Douse the fucker！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.46,2:12:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gotcha！
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.09,2:12:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.91,2:13:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't come any closer。- Wait。They're here to help.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:11.53,2:13:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay where you are！
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.94,2:13:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ripley。- Bishop.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.36,2:13:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm here to help you。- No more bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.95,2:13:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just felt it move.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:24.62,2:13:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You know who I am？- You're a droid.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.04,2:13:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Same model as Bishop。Sent by the fucking company.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.13,2:13:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I'm not the Bishop android.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.25,2:13:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I designed it.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:37.59,2:13:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm very human.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:40.18,2:13:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,The company sent me here to show you a friendly face，
Dialogue: 0,2:13:42.55,2:13:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,to demonstrate how important you are to us，
Dialogue: 0,2:13:46.39,2:13:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:48.10,2:13:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You just want to take it back。- We want to kill it and take you home.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:51.44,2:13:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bullshit。- You're wrong。We want to help.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:56.53,2:13:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,What does that mean？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.07,2:14:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We're gonna take that out of you。- And keep it.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.48,2:14:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't allow it to live。Everything we know would be in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.57,2:14:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't want to take it back？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:11.91,2:14:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley，time is important。Let us deal with the malignancy.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:17.75,2:14:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got a surgical bay set up on the rescue ship.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:21.92,2:14:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come with me。It's very quick.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.59,2:14:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Painless。A couple of incisions。You'll be out for two hours.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:33.51,2:14:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then it's over.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:40.77,2:14:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You still can have a life，children-
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.53,2:14:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,And most important，you'll know it's dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:50.70,2:14:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.12,2:14:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,What guarantee do I have…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:58.58,2:15:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,once you've taken it out，you'll destroy it？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.96,2:15:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.88,2:15:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please？Trust me？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.85,2:15:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.86,2:15:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's this gonna achieve？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.66,2:15:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stop！- Ow！Oh，Jesus！
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.76,2:15:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morse.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:42.29,2:15:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Will you help me？- What do you want me to do？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:49.59,2:15:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was a mistake！There was no need for any of it！
Dialogue: 0,2:15:53.09,2:15:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fucking android！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.03,2:16:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not a droid！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:18.58,2:16:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley，think of all we could learn from it.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:23.12,2:16:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the chance of a lifetime！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.34,2:16:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must let me have it！It's a magnificent specimen！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.55,2:16:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Jesus！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.39,2:16:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,No pictures！
Dialogue: 0,2:17:06.79,2:17:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:09.13,2:17:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.35,2:17:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,2:18:22.99,2:18:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on，you。Get going。- Oh，fuck you！
Dialogue: 0,2:18:33.04,2:18:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ash，Captain Dallas are dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:36.47,2:18:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cargo and ship destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.34,2:18:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should reach the frontier in about six weeks.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:44.64,2:18:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,With a little luck，the network will pick me up.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.44,2:18:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Ripley，
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.48,2:18:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,last survivor of the Nostromo，signing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:52.25,Title,0,0,0,0,,《异形3》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,静态平衡受到干扰，低温舱发生火警
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.87,0:02:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,重覆，低温舱发生火警
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.46,0:02:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人员速到…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.46,0:02:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急逃生小艇发射台报到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.26,0:02:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空飞行将在…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,20秒后开始
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:12.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（费欧娜「复仇」161星 外围矿沙提炼厂）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:16.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（双Y染色体 劳改监狱）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.70,0:04:20.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（最高设防监狱）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.83,0:06:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘逃生艇坠落
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.05,0:06:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,到沙滩去，可能还有其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.21,0:06:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.67,0:06:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.01,0:06:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快醒醒！快醒醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！弗兰克！快！走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.40,0:07:24.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（费欧娜161C级监狱 报告逃生小艇2650坠落）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.05,0:07:28.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蕾普莉中尉：生还者）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.95,0:07:56.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（希克斯下士：死亡）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:05.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（身份不明女性：死亡）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.85,0:08:10.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（约10岁）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:33.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（要求最迅速紧急救援）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:37.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（等候回应 狱长安德鲁斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克，进去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,着陆真猛！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,用手电筒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:08:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有多少？- 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.89,0:08:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,3个，也许4个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，弗兰克，速度起来，5分钟后就零下40度
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:09.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（致费欧娜161C级监狱）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:13.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（通讯卫星通报：伟伦优达尼公司收到报告）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，大家集合
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,集合了，快点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了，迪伦先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.10,0:09:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,主呀，给我们力量来坚守
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.89,0:09:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是上帝手中卑微的罪人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,请以手包围我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.82,0:09:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,守护我们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.74,0:10:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿门 - 阿门
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢各位，这是谣言管制会议
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,以下是案情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.59,0:10:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.17,0:10:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一架337型号紧急逃生艇…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.63,0:10:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在早上六点…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠落此地
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有一名生还者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,两具尸体，以及损毁得无法维修的生化人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.88,0:10:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,生还者是个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.38,0:10:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说我已经发誓，要终生禁欲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都发誓过 - 包括对女人在内
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.43,0:10:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 我们全都发过誓
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭上你的臭嘴 - 我要说的第一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.35,0:10:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢公司政策…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:10:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她和囚犯及狱卒混在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:11:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位兄弟想说的是任何外人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.90,0:11:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是一个女人，都会破坏这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.61,0:11:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,和谐统一的精神
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道，大家的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已申请救援小组前来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,若无阻碍，一周内将到达
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.75,0:11:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后尽快将她带离此地
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来这一套！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的身体状况如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤势不重
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.84,0:11:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前昏迷中，未能做更精确诊断
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她能活下来吗？- 我想应该会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.98,0:11:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都不希望…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.98,0:11:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女人在救援小组到达前离开医疗室
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人伴随更不可以，对吗？- 是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位，我们必须坚守日常生活…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要过度激动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.87,0:11:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们最好早点到，否则她就死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.55,0:12:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己调的鸡尾酒，给你前所未有的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.68,0:12:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是医生？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.18,0:13:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫克莱门斯，这里的医疗主任
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.81,0:13:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里？- 复仇161星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河系最偏远的劳动监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一提起就令我伤心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西是镇静剂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.12,0:13:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得剃掉你的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的头虱很多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.71,0:13:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你感觉好点，我帮你剪发
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.33,0:13:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你自己剪耻毛 - 我是怎么来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你乘坐的逃生艇坠毁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.55,0:13:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入大气层前才脱离你的母船
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.14,0:13:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你长眠多久吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.56,0:13:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你突然苏醒，可能对身体有影响
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会病几个星期 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.69,0:13:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其他人呢？- 全死了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 无一幸存
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.49,0:14:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要到船上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要到船上 - 你现在还不能去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.12,0:14:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我穿衣服，还是你要我这样出去？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.09,0:14:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到本地居民的性情，我建议你穿衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好久没见过女色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里曾经收容五千名囚犯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.43,0:14:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在却只有25名
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.18,0:14:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保持火焰不熄 - 什么火焰？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,封闭式熔炉，天然沼气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.94,0:14:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有个铸造厂，蕾普莉中尉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,囚犯打造铅片，围堵有毒废物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我的名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就写在你短裤背面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.34,0:15:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把铁缆松开！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尸体在哪里？- 在殓房
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查小组一个星期后到达
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有一名生化人 - 残缺不全
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.37,0:15:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把残骸丢到垃圾场
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那名下士被安全支架刺死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,死得不明不白
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女孩呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.09,0:15:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…溺死在低温舱内
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她没有知觉…当她死去时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪里？- 在停尸间
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看看她的遗体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.01,0:16:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何你这么坚持？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，我要确定她的死因
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这种事情实在不必罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.15,0:16:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她很明显是溺死的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.57,0:17:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是你女儿吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，她不是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我独处一下，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.55,0:19:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.14,0:19:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.43,0:19:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得验尸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.43,0:19:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得查清楚她的死因
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.90,0:19:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过，她是溺死的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.28,0:19:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢肯定，我们得看看她的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你精神恍惚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.41,0:19:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很好的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.49,0:19:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就请你把理由告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.83,0:19:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很可能受到感染
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.79,0:19:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪种感染？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.76,0:19:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 霍乱 - 霍乱？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,两百年来，一宗霍乱病例都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.98,0:20:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.48,0:20:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切正常
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有感染的迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有疾病的征状 - 胸腔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开胸腔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.16,0:21:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,肺部
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满液体
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.20,0:21:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她是溺死的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.55,0:21:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告诉我，你到底在找什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.31,0:22:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱门斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.73,0:22:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,狱长
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.32,0:22:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没见过蕾普莉中尉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.82,0:22:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事，克莱门斯先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.91,0:22:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，长官，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.41,0:22:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.50,0:22:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴蕾普莉中尉，已经觉得好很多
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.42,0:22:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外，基于公共卫生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.01,0:22:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我正在验尸 - 没有我的同意？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.76,0:22:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来不及向你请示
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.26,0:22:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果一切无碍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.26,0:22:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有感染 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.76,0:22:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉中尉最好别在囚犯面前走动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.60,0:22:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说她已经这么做过
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.81,0:22:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我很有帮助…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.81,0:22:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的状况若有变化，你也要让我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.94,0:22:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要求过分吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体必须火葬
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.15,0:22:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡扯，我们要保存尸体，直到救援小组到达
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.91,0:23:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷藏保存 - 这会影响公共卫生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.37,0:23:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾中尉认为目前仍有传染病存在的可能
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.46,0:23:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说没有疾病征状？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.80,0:23:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子看来是溺死的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.01,0:23:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过未经化验
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.64,0:23:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不可能完全确定的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.64,0:23:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为不该忽视…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.97,0:23:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,感染病毒的可能
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.81,0:23:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是霍乱突然蔓延，你一定会面目无光
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.40,0:23:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是，长官？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.03,0:23:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这所监狱的25名囚犯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.86,0:23:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都有双Y染色体
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.03,0:23:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是小偷、强奸犯、杀人犯，全都是人渣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.33,0:23:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们信教，并不代表他们很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.17,0:23:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不干涉他们的信仰
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.67,0:23:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不想扰乱这里的秩序
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.34,0:23:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想引发风波
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.84,0:24:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不让女人勾起他们的邪念
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.93,0:24:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂了，为我自身安全着想
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.14,0:24:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.19,0:24:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把火葬的事交给你，克莱门斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.19,0:24:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以用熔炉，不过十点以前要回牢房
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.32,0:24:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.56,0:24:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣诞节提早到来 - 什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.98,0:24:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有死牛就是好的 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.07,0:24:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,满身跳蚤的臭东西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.40,0:25:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只剩下七只，就算处理完了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.49,0:25:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,最讨厌冲洗这臭东西
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.87,0:25:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次搞得我浑身是粪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.45,0:25:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起臭东西，对了，弗兰克
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.67,0:25:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有机会的话，你想跟她说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.33,0:25:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？- 你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.67,0:25:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有机会的话，你是说平常的时候吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.55,0:25:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，要是在饭堂遇到，你会说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.89,0:25:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.01,0:25:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对女人很有办法
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.02,0:25:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会说：「午安，亲爱的，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.02,0:25:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你做什么吗？「
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.73,0:25:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后看着她，从上看到下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.78,0:25:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后眨眼睛，色迷迷的笑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.24,0:25:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她就会明白 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.78,0:25:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就会说：「来亲我吧，老色鬼」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.54,0:25:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去亲她
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.29,0:25:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去亲她，浑身上下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.37,0:25:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对，但要粗暴点，激烈点，明白吗？- 告诉你，墨菲
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.25,0:26:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把王后当妓女，把妓女当是王后
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.09,0:26:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.61,0:26:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女孩是怎么死的？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.77,0:26:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道，反正已归西
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.48,0:26:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她多大？- 11岁吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.10,0:26:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,正值青春，算了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.28,0:26:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下切碎了，一样要丢进炉里 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.24,0:26:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.24,0:26:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.39,0:27:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,「这孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.39,0:27:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,和这男人，已离开我们的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.98,0:27:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的肉身…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.32,0:27:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,已远离黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.95,0:27:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们获得解脱…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.99,0:27:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离黑暗与痛苦「
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.21,0:28:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,「这孩子和这男人…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.55,0:28:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,已离开我们的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.22,0:28:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已达到永恒…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.10,0:28:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,永垂不朽
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.57,0:28:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,尘归尘，土归土「
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.03,0:28:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.91,0:28:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么无辜者受到惩罚？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.13,0:28:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么必须牺牲？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.80,0:28:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么有痛苦？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.34,0:28:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,世间原无承诺
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.47,0:28:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,世事无常
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,少数人能蒙主宠召，得到拯救
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.69,0:29:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会了解我们留在人世…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.57,0:29:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须面对的困苦和伤痛
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.28,0:29:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将遗体交托于虚无…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.03,0:29:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且满心欢喜
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.51,0:29:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为每一颗种子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.51,0:29:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,必将长出花朵
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.97,0:29:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.10,0:29:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论多么微不足道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.44,0:29:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一个新生命
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.69,0:29:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个新的开始
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.91,0:29:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿门
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.87,0:30:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿门
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.24,0:30:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.15,0:30:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一生还者是女人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.91,0:30:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会制造什么麻烦？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.12,0:30:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经改变这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.25,0:30:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们他妈的该怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.97,0:30:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.39,0:31:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是开玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.09,0:31:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.26,0:31:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多谣言说这里不很和谐
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.81,0:31:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以告诉我是什么问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.44,0:31:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我，兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.28,0:32:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.28,0:32:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怕黑暗和虫子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.08,0:32:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不怕每周一次走进又湿又冷的隧道中
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.25,0:32:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也不怕，但我讨厌葛立
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.31,0:32:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.48,0:32:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，他又臭又疯疯癫癫
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.75,0:32:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再和他一起出去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.45,0:32:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么话要说？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.87,0:32:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是得跟着你们
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.50,0:32:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛立只是个可怜的废人，和你我没有不同
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.55,0:32:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他很臭 - 还疯疯癫癫
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.80,0:32:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,少跟我来这套！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.34,0:32:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有事要做
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.47,0:32:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再听到任何有关葛立的事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.98,0:33:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.25,0:33:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.50,0:34:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦先生，如我所想
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.04,0:34:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如我所想 - 你作主吧，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.64,0:34:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想谢谢你在葬体说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.81,0:34:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友一定会很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.77,0:34:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想认识我，小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.65,0:34:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是专杀女人的强奸犯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.15,0:34:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.49,0:34:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我一定令你很紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.80,0:34:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有任何信仰吗，妹子？- 谈不上
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.60,0:35:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有很足够的信仰，甚至足够让你加入
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.06,0:35:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为女人不准加入
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.57,0:35:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前从未有过女人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.87,0:35:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们容忍任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.61,0:35:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 甚至令人无法容忍的人 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.32,0:35:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是原则，不是针对你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.08,0:35:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里等待最好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.50,0:35:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到现在…没有任何诱惑
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.51,0:35:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在等什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.35,0:35:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等上帝回来…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.69,0:35:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,救赎我们
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.61,0:35:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年前迪伦和其他人…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.70,0:36:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受宗教信仰
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.37,0:36:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再喝一杯 - 我正在服药
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.58,0:36:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不见得吧 - 哪一种宗教？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.13,0:36:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种相信千年末世的，基督教原教旨主义派
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.67,0:36:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 正是
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.09,0:36:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是公司想关闭监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.01,0:36:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦和其他人希望留下
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.77,0:36:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们获准以守卫身份留下…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.98,0:36:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上两名管理员…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.98,0:36:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一名医疗主任
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.74,0:36:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我们
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.90,0:36:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么得到这么好的差事？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.49,0:36:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢这新发型吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.33,0:36:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还算好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.35,0:37:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为了你得罪安德鲁斯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.14,0:37:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和那好人的关系现在更加恶化
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.48,0:37:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也向你说过…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.98,0:37:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇161星的无聊历史
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.90,0:37:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可否告诉我在女孩体内找什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.37,0:37:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得我有吸引力吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.49,0:37:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一方面？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.75,0:37:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,「那」方面
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.54,0:37:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很直接
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.13,0:37:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我流浪了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.14,0:37:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.64,0:38:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.74,0:38:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！史派克！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.91,0:38:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在下面吗？在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.54,0:39:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙你垂青我真的很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.05,0:39:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我注意到你回避我的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.01,0:39:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然你用的方法很巧妙
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.73,0:39:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真扫兴
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.90,0:39:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得尽我的职责
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.90,0:40:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道为何要火葬
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.86,0:40:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为既然上了你的床
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.82,0:40:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就应该回答你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.28,0:40:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得给我一个理由
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.08,0:40:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这与上不上床无关
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.71,0:40:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在长眠期间发了可怕的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.71,0:40:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得知道是什么害死她
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.55,0:40:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能错了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.68,0:40:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.76,0:40:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我又犯了错
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.89,0:40:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？什么错？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.89,0:40:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,和囚犯搞关系
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.82,0:40:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉体接触，这触犯规律，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.07,0:40:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 几时发生的？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.28,0:40:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.03,0:40:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是囚犯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.04,0:41:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑后有一个电脑条码
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.55,0:41:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那的确应该解释
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.05,0:41:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过现在还未到时候
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.22,0:41:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，我令你觉得扫兴
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.77,0:41:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱门斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.02,0:41:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亚伦先生 - 狱长安德鲁斯，要你…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.90,0:41:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上到22号通风孔
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.74,0:41:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了意外 - 严重吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.87,0:41:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这么说，有一名囚犯…被切碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.29,0:41:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.42,0:41:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有职务在身
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.74,0:42:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁那么倒霉？- 墨菲
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.37,0:42:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.46,0:42:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他的靴子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.63,0:42:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我派他来的，他是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.51,0:42:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别自责，亚伦先生，不是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.77,0:42:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好说的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.98,0:42:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他当场死亡 - 可不是
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.11,0:42:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他被吸入风扇
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.57,0:42:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然而来的一阵风
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.61,0:42:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，我也差点被卷进风扇
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.78,0:43:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过多少次，离风扇远点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.24,0:43:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人肯听
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.25,0:43:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了风扇一直吹着
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.34,0:43:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？- 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.51,0:43:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,半小时后来见我，克莱门斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.81,0:43:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有头绪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.57,0:44:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿，你一个人到处乱走…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.40,0:44:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,会气死安德鲁斯
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.32,0:44:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那件意外是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.74,0:44:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名囚犯死了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.50,0:44:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？怎么死的？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.92,0:44:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在通风孔
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.54,0:44:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的家伙，掉进9尺长的风扇
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.21,0:44:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在离现场不远
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.63,0:44:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现一样东西
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.14,0:44:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个印痕，烧过的痕迹
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.22,0:44:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你在那女孩的低温舱，所发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.48,0:45:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，我跟你同一阵线
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.49,0:45:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮你，但我要知道这是怎么回事…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.08,0:45:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是你认为这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.08,0:45:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你想帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.17,0:45:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就找一部语音电脑…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.42,0:45:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我解读航行记录器
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.63,0:45:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有那种设备
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.88,0:45:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 主教呢？- 主教？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.13,0:45:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起坠机的生化人？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.72,0:45:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能指给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.18,0:45:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能陪你去
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.26,0:45:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和别人有约
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.06,0:45:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,掉下来了，葛立，不要乱弄
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.98,0:45:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样？根本没有包好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.99,0:45:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他笨头笨脑 - 只会吃
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.20,0:45:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脑满肠肥 - 葛立！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.57,0:45:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为墨菲点枝蜡烛 - 我会点很多支
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.12,0:45:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.75,0:45:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,从未抱怨过
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.13,0:46:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢他
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.09,0:46:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的是那样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.18,0:46:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的头被打碎了？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.64,0:46:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有火柴？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.98,0:46:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克莱门斯先生，请坐 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.03,0:46:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加糖？- 不用
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.11,0:46:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加奶？- 一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.37,0:46:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，亚伦先生
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.17,0:46:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我听好，你这浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.51,0:46:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再耍我，我就斩开你两半
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.64,0:46:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，我听不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.76,0:46:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,七点我接到总公司的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.89,0:46:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知，那是这儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.81,0:46:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到的第一份高阶层讯息
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.02,0:47:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我们看牢这女人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.03,0:47:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是最高优先考虑 - 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.82,0:47:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.20,0:47:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何让她离开医疗室？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.58,0:47:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲发生意外是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.83,0:47:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让人满脑子歪念乱跑
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.92,0:47:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是医生，你是狱卒
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.38,0:47:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道你的真面目
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.13,0:47:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下，我认为我最好离开
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.34,0:47:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你身边令我非常不愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.14,0:47:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？你要想想，克莱门斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.60,0:47:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我把你的臭史…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.77,0:47:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你的新朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.11,0:47:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了她个人的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.98,0:47:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我坐下来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.16,0:48:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你，你喜怒无常
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.42,0:48:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,傲慢无理，也可能很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.30,0:48:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对任何事都有疑问！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.26,0:48:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这里不需要医疗主任
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.80,0:48:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上要你滚蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.14,0:48:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我感激不尽 - 少讲风凉话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.43,0:48:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…我该知道什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.02,0:48:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关于什么？- 那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.36,0:48:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,少骗我，你几乎随时在她旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.99,0:48:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼才相信你是为了治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.87,0:48:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟你说过什么？她从哪里来？有什么任务？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.83,0:48:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会在逃生艇内？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.08,0:48:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她们打了败仗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.96,0:48:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想其他都是机密
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.55,0:48:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没再给她压力
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.97,0:48:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这样？- 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.09,0:48:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？- 对
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.26,0:48:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有了？- 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.02,0:49:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.84,0:50:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！婊子！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.30,0:50:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 进去！- 闭嘴！贱人！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.76,0:51:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人听得见你 - 他妈的！放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.02,0:51:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的！不！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.73,0:51:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.81,0:51:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！见鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.45,0:51:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.66,0:51:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这王八蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.33,0:51:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走，我得重新教育几位弟兄
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.63,0:51:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈一下心灵改革的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.98,0:51:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,香烟！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.91,0:52:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,干吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.71,0:52:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有十条街这么长
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.84,0:52:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有多少？- 这是第176个
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.35,0:52:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃东西小声点
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.02,0:52:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在算这区段有多大
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.27,0:52:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么吵我无法思考
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.19,0:52:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说脏话 - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.11,0:52:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们绕行过整个区段 - 嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.61,0:52:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.04,0:52:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么狗屁玩意？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.08,0:52:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说脏话 - 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.92,0:52:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,说「狗屁」没关系，我又没骂上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.50,0:52:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜡烛怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.34,0:53:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是附近通风孔
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.26,0:53:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,吹来的逆风
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.14,0:53:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是蜡烛都被吹熄，我们怎么知道位置？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.23,0:53:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,只好派人回去重新点亮
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.00,0:53:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.08,0:53:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点，兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.84,0:53:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，谁在开玩笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.68,0:54:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.68,0:54:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快跑！快！抓住！- 救我！救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.64,0:54:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.61,0:54:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！走！快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.29,0:54:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿来！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.20,0:55:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这臭东西弄掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.71,0:55:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,操！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.00,0:55:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.06,0:56:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.44,0:56:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.73,0:56:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！主教，你感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.44,0:56:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的腿很痛
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.49,0:56:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.78,0:56:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系，我只是个烤面包机
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.45,0:56:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.79,0:56:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的新发型
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.16,0:57:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,主教，你能查出航行记录器资料？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.90,0:57:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.15,0:57:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛立？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.94,0:57:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 苏拉可号发生什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.58,0:57:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,低温舱为何弹射出来？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.29,0:57:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,静态平衡受干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.92,0:57:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,低温舱起火
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.92,0:57:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 重覆，低温舱… - 怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.47,0:57:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么起火的，主教？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.10,0:57:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听得到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.39,0:58:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,电线短路
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.48,0:58:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,地板的材料烧起来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.81,0:58:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,救生船脱离母舰前有没有东西在舰上？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.48,0:58:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿好暗，蕾普莉，我的视力大不如前
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.03,0:58:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我，记录器有没有显示？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.49,0:58:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰上有没有异形？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.45,0:58:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.58,0:58:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它还在苏拉可号，还是和我们一起坠机？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.80,0:58:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一直都和我们一起
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.36,0:58:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,公司知不知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.48,0:58:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,公司知道舰上的每一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.78,0:58:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都输入电脑，传回总公司
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.24,0:59:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还是要异形
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.29,0:59:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮个忙，切断电源
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.67,0:59:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我被修好，也无法回复正常
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.84,0:59:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿消失
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.59,0:59:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.84,0:59:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当为我好吧，蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.57,0:59:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我！不是我干的！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.57,0:59:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…是那一条龙
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.79,0:59:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸食人的心灵
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.08,0:59:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁也无法阻挡 - 博格斯和雷恩斯呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.50,0:59:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全像猪一样被宰了 - 不是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.92,0:59:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是我 - 他完全疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.76,0:59:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,早该用铁炼锁住
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.51,0:59:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对，长官，他发疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.93,1:00:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他隔离，别引起恐慌
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.81,1:00:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱门斯，让这白痴安静下来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.46,1:00:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得先弄清楚弟兄的下落
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.56,1:00:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作一点，告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.52,1:00:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 博格斯和雷恩斯在哪里？- 不是我！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.49,1:00:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有用，问不出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.49,1:00:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是我！- 我们得派出搜索队
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.41,1:00:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕有很大几率…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.83,1:00:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这畜牲会杀了他们
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.04,1:00:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.42,1:00:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没骗过我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.25,1:00:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个疯疯癫癫的傻子，不过他不会说谎
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.55,1:00:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的是实话
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.97,1:00:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟他谈谈这条龙
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.18,1:00:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是一条龙 - 你别想跟任何人说话，中尉
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.23,1:00:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的意见没兴趣
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.19,1:00:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本搞不清状况
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.40,1:00:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾犯下多宗杀人案，是个残忍的凶手
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.03,1:00:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对，迪伦先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.78,1:01:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对…那是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.99,1:01:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就和你谈，这很重要
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.58,1:01:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完成职务后
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.08,1:01:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,很乐意和你谈
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.59,1:01:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我弄清楚，中尉，这生物有8尺高
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.05,1:01:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,血液是强酸，坐你的太空船到达此地
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.39,1:01:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它见人就杀，性情不太友善
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.98,1:01:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然期望我信你的话
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.60,1:01:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我不期望任何事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.07,1:01:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 故事很精彩，亚伦先生 - 是的，很精彩
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.99,1:01:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没听过这种故事 - 我想也没有
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.03,1:01:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我，你建议我们怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.49,1:01:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有什么武器？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.00,1:01:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是监狱
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.08,1:01:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让囚犯碰武器
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.63,1:01:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免他们杀了你？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.50,1:01:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，它根本逃不出去
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.55,1:02:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一班补给船到达时，公司会派人消灭它
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.59,1:02:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个最高设防的监狱
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.97,1:02:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们却没有任何武器？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.98,1:02:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠宰场有几把屠刀，饭堂也有
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.86,1:02:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有几把消防斧头，没有太多厉害武器
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.36,1:02:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这些？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.74,1:02:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们推行荣誉制度
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.50,1:02:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们完蛋了 - 不，只有你完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.79,1:02:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你关在医疗室
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.25,1:02:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦先生会护送你去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.05,1:02:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那儿最安全，对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.35,1:02:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才乖
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.52,1:02:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体到饭堂报到
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.27,1:03:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,狱长安德鲁斯要开会，立刻到饭堂报到
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.36,1:03:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能离开？有办法逃生？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.53,1:03:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,补给船每六个月来一次
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.37,1:03:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只有这样？- 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.45,1:03:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.37,1:03:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就有人来接你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.71,1:03:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快是多快？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.59,1:03:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道，以前没有人急着来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.93,1:03:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说，安德鲁斯和你谈些什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.93,1:03:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.31,1:03:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会说我疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.40,1:03:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说有点不厚道
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.53,1:03:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.58,1:03:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.79,1:03:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,喉咙痛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.79,1:04:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,胃部不舒服，而且气坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.79,1:04:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这种情况下我能了解
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.76,1:04:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我该给你打一剂特别的药
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.34,1:04:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么大家都互相指责？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.22,1:04:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,人非圣贤，我们只是凡人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.85,1:04:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有一个人是完美的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.23,1:04:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是疯狂世界
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.40,1:04:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,正常人…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.94,1:04:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也要变成疯子
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.49,1:04:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 讲得真好，葛立 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.83,1:04:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你结婚了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.79,1:04:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我？- 你应该结婚生子
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.46,1:04:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么漂亮，我曾认识很多漂亮女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.76,1:04:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们很喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.10,1:04:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,过一阵子就变心
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.15,1:05:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会死的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.16,1:05:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有没有？- 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.95,1:05:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,结婚
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.29,1:05:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.79,1:05:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是好奇 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.96,1:05:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也坦白点，如何？- 讲清楚一点
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.30,1:05:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没说你为何被派来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.01,1:05:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提到你脑后的监狱识别条码
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.31,1:05:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又顾左右而言他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.15,1:05:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长，令人伤心…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.57,1:05:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且通俗煽情
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.99,1:05:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来听听
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.36,1:05:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你这么想听
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.58,1:06:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我毕业以后
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.04,1:06:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我已经…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.09,1:06:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗啡上瘾
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.59,1:06:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍被认为是
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.92,1:06:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,最有前途的医生
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.39,1:06:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当专科实习医生在急诊室当值36小时
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.94,1:06:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跑出去喝得酩酊大醉
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.56,1:06:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我又被召回
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.82,1:06:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一座炼油厂的蒸汽炉爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.07,1:06:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,30名伤者
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.24,1:06:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,11人死亡
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.66,1:06:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是因为意外…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.91,1:06:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是因为我开错止痛药剂量
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.50,1:06:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我服刑七年，执照被降为3C
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.46,1:06:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我戒掉吗啡瘾
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.88,1:06:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.80,1:06:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的惩罚还算轻
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.06,1:07:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里服刑？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.14,1:07:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和这群乌合之众混熟了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.15,1:07:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们留下来，我也留下了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.44,1:07:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人愿意聘用我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.20,1:07:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还愿意让我打针吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.96,1:08:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.88,1:09:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,主呀，给我们力量来坚守
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.68,1:09:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是上帝手中卑微的罪人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.31,1:09:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请以手包围我们，守护我们
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.77,1:09:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿门 - 这里出了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.65,1:09:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了这么一大堆事情
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.15,1:09:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人死了，有人要强暴，弟兄出了麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.24,1:09:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再闹事了！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.70,1:09:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了问题，我们要团结
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.50,1:09:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，谢谢，迪伦先生
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.42,1:09:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一次，这是谣言管制会议
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.63,1:09:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,以下是案情
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.26,1:09:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上八点，囚犯墨菲
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.01,1:09:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为粗心
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.93,1:09:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第17通风孔死去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.85,1:09:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他似乎被吸入通风扇门
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.86,1:09:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上九点
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.69,1:10:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,囚犯葛立出现精神错乱
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.90,1:10:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,囚犯博格斯和雷恩斯失踪
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.28,1:10:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能是遇害…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.04,1:10:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭囚犯葛立杀害
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.25,1:10:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须组组一支搜索队
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.12,1:10:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人自愿我们会很感激
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.38,1:10:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座监狱一直相安无事…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.64,1:10:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然出现一些问题
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.56,1:10:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望大家能在这几天提起精神…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.52,1:10:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到救援小组接走蕾普莉中尉
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.82,1:10:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来了，它杀死克莱门斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.86,1:10:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上停止这种谣言 - 我跟你说它来了！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.66,1:10:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦，把那笨女人带回医疗室！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.87,1:10:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.25,1:10:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.13,1:11:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.89,1:11:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,主呀，我们感谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.02,1:11:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的愤怒已显现，我们知道审判快到
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.06,1:11:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日将要降临
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.15,1:11:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们有所准备，得到您的饶恕
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.87,1:11:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好可怕 - 阿门
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.62,1:11:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 速度 - 我在那里，我看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.24,1:11:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该怎么办？谁来指挥？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.59,1:11:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得组组起来，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.17,1:11:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，我有指挥权
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.97,1:11:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让85指挥？完了 - 别那么叫我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.64,1:11:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能取代安德鲁斯
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.10,1:11:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是好人，虽然你们不喜欢他
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.89,1:11:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦，我们不想听屁话
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.15,1:12:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,妹子，你呢？你是个军官
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.27,1:12:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,展露一点领导才能吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.28,1:12:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管她 你来指挥
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.32,1:12:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 反正这里都是你在管
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.66,1:12:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 我没当官的材料
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.74,1:12:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只会管我自己
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.00,1:12:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这臭怪物想要什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.34,1:12:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这老妈到底指不指挥？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.63,1:12:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要 - 这下可好
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.30,1:12:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么阻止它？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.64,1:12:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们没有武器，对吧？- 对
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.52,1:12:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到的和这只不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.31,1:12:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的动作有点不同
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.86,1:12:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他那些什么都不怕
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.45,1:12:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,只怕火
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.74,1:12:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能不能封锁这地方？- 没办法
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.00,1:12:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个监狱10平方英里
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.29,1:13:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 共有六百个通气管 - 录影设备呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.62,1:13:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到处都有闭路电视系统
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.42,1:13:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭路电视系统多年没用，这里什么都不能用
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.63,1:13:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多科技用品都没办法修好
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.93,1:13:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 85想说的是… - 别那么叫我！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.43,1:13:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有娱乐中心，气候控制
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.60,1:13:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有视讯系统，没有监视
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.27,1:13:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有电雪柜，没有雪糕
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.86,1:13:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有避孕套，没有女人，没有枪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.73,1:13:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.90,1:13:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟她谈有个屁用？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.70,1:13:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把那臭东西带来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.20,1:13:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不砍下她的头，塞进墙壁？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.16,1:13:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样最好
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.50,1:13:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔斯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.42,1:13:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.51,1:13:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.52,1:14:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.99,1:14:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.54,1:14:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条通道从饭堂通往医疗室
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.70,1:14:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个通风孔
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.79,1:14:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从那里进去把它逼出来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.21,1:14:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的隧道有好几里长
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.22,1:14:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它走不了太远
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.26,1:14:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会在这里筑巢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.64,1:14:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.64,1:14:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这附近 - 你怎么知道？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.40,1:14:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就像只狮子
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.02,1:14:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧跟着斑马群
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.32,1:14:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,斑马？这可好
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.82,1:14:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么暗跑来跑去？别开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.57,1:14:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,走出主通风孔就没有电灯
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.07,1:15:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是有手电筒吗？- 有几千个，但没有电池
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.33,1:15:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说了，都废弃了 - 火把呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.21,1:15:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能生火吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.29,1:15:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类从石器时代起就有这能力
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.67,1:15:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用不着讽刺我
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.68,1:15:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没用过，这里打算放核废料
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.68,1:15:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直没空，里头空无一物
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.89,1:15:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是出入的唯一通道？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.44,1:15:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，墙壁有6尺多厚，实心钢造的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.27,1:15:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,建造起来真是大工程
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.77,1:15:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何东西被关进去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.78,1:15:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对出不来？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.02,1:15:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，无路可逃
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.54,1:15:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们放在这里，忘了叫什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.00,1:15:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圭乃特利西特林 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.59,1:15:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把工作分配好，让迪伦…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.93,1:15:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,漆油
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.64,1:16:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在… - 大卫
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.14,1:16:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把这些油桶整理好 - 知道了，85
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.27,1:16:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有…别那么叫我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.15,1:16:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,85到底是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.15,1:16:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们偷看过他的档案
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.53,1:16:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他的智商
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.67,1:16:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过这种油桶…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.88,1:16:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,掉在海滩木屋
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.13,1:16:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸令码头三个半月没有鱼群
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.67,1:16:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害的玩意！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.07,1:16:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我搞清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.20,1:16:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想用火把它烧出通风管
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.70,1:16:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼进这里，把门锁上…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.96,1:16:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后把它困住？- 对
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.67,1:16:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我们这些天生罪犯帮忙？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.74,1:16:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有别的事要做吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.70,1:17:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为何要替你冒险拼命？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.57,1:17:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们早就有危险
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.83,1:17:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.54,1:17:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.76,1:17:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.85,1:17:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,两千个电池，只有一个用得着
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.43,1:17:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还未算最糟
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.73,1:17:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能照不亮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.94,1:17:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意真臭
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.62,1:17:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的要臭死人了 - 那就别呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.59,1:17:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该要戴氧气筒 - 你要我闷死！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.63,1:18:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要深呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.01,1:18:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会很兴奋 - 感情好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.94,1:18:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想念医生，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.90,1:18:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这么说？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.49,1:18:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个很亲密
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.45,1:18:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你很爱偷窥
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.45,1:18:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是那么想的！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.59,1:18:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？- 还好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.38,1:18:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？可是你看起来不太好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.64,1:18:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.19,1:18:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这地方
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.15,1:19:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.20,1:19:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我们，绝对还有别的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.12,1:19:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没打信号别点火
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.99,1:19:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是信号
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.66,1:19:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗？记得住吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.38,1:19:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.56,1:20:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴哈
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.78,1:20:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不等信号？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.24,1:20:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.00,1:20:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，我们得找出洒水器
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.55,1:20:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快救他们！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.89,1:20:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！跑呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.89,1:21:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,到废料处理场，别开门！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.33,1:22:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊！- 不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.29,1:22:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的，我们一定会救你
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.72,1:22:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,火熄了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.56,1:22:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱德，去把洒水器打开
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.23,1:22:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快带他出去
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.12,1:22:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带你出去
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.08,1:22:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在你后面！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.55,1:22:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.51,1:22:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.19,1:23:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.15,1:23:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,来捉我呀！混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.49,1:24:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他们受难
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.74,1:24:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们仍应欣慰
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.92,1:24:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,向他们的勇气致敬
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.30,1:24:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会永垂不朽
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.39,1:25:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡并不代表真正死去
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.97,1:25:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们升上天去
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.85,1:25:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了更高的境界
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.61,1:25:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯子
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.40,1:25:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱门斯常叫做迪伦圣兵 令他们幸免于难
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.03,1:25:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不信宗教？- 我？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.87,1:25:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不，我要工作
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.87,1:25:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.25,1:25:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想救援队四五天就会到了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.29,1:25:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,顶多是六天
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.50,1:25:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一来，拿出机关枪轰死它
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.05,1:25:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有消息吗？- 没有
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.97,1:25:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只说收到讯息
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.56,1:25:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来又说，你是最高优先考虑
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.36,1:25:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也不说
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.61,1:25:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们在边疆
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.90,1:26:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他们不想杀怪物呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.24,1:26:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带回去吗？- 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.45,1:26:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们疯了，一定要杀了它
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.79,1:26:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.67,1:26:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔斯，把我放开
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.80,1:26:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.64,1:26:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很痛
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.43,1:26:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.47,1:26:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.77,1:26:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要和我说话 - 拜托，我做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.40,1:26:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你我要怎么做，我要看管着你，那是我的事
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.03,1:26:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想惹怒迪伦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.74,1:26:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只告诉他，那条龙杀了博格斯和雷恩斯
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.66,1:26:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说谎，你看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.37,1:26:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶，我看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.33,1:26:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.83,1:26:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一进来，我就死了，我跑不了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.92,1:27:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不会来的，它会被困住
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.72,1:27:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不会怎样，快点，放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.68,1:27:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我每次都先给你烟 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.48,1:27:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.52,1:27:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你，莫尔斯
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.65,1:27:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何不可？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.99,1:27:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖一点，不准惹事…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.58,1:27:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害我
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.26,1:27:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怪物在哪里？- 在废置炉
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.80,1:27:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它困住
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.56,1:27:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想再看看怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.19,1:27:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么鬼话？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.07,1:28:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不给你香烟了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.62,1:28:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一步完成了，要说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.87,1:28:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们是我们捉的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.33,1:28:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那叫什么？- 异形怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.55,1:28:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.55,1:28:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么拼音？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.27,1:28:41.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（捉到异形怪物）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.60,1:28:45.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（请批准消灭）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.78,1:28:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀不了的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.53,1:28:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又没有武器 - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.08,1:28:53.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（致费欧娜161C级监狱 通讯卫星通报：收到报告）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.37,1:28:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧，就是这样，当我们狗屁
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.15,1:28:58.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（救援队将在12时抵达）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.29,1:28:59.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不允许消灭异形怪物）
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.15,1:29:01.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（救援队到达前避免接触）
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.85,1:29:06.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（要求不批准）
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.69,1:29:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时好时坏 - 你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.82,1:29:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话呀
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.49,1:29:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以进去，那怪物会吃掉你的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.25,1:29:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.92,1:29:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉！抱歉！抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.20,1:30:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.36,1:30:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要来带走怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.23,1:30:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会这么做，根本就不杀死
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.61,1:30:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.20,1:30:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们要杀它？反正公司会来解决
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.33,1:31:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，他们是来带走怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.46,1:31:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用作研究武器 - 有何不可？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.33,1:31:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们控制不了，他们不知道它的危险性
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.00,1:31:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了，有何不可？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.92,1:31:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有…但很多无辜的人会死
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.01,1:31:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你有宗教信仰
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.10,1:31:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.60,1:31:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的世界对我们已经不存在
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.90,1:31:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有自己的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.74,1:31:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不大，却是我们的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.49,1:31:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人都可以死吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.37,1:31:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，所有人都可以
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.59,1:31:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪伦 - 是
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.92,1:31:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦，有个小问题
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.28,1:32:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下好了！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.57,1:32:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那疯小子放走怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.28,1:32:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,自作自受
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.29,1:32:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.29,1:32:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德鲁斯是对的，应该把那小子锁住的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.59,1:32:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.05,1:32:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,去她的，那怪物还在外面，该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.30,1:32:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.01,1:32:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这小王八蛋让葛立逃跑！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.14,1:32:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，住嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.98,1:32:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫那个小丑识相点！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.27,1:32:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.65,1:32:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,到逃生艇
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.90,1:33:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 我们得用神经扫描器
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.66,1:33:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看来很憔悴 - 管她好不好
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.87,1:33:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在怎么办？- 你想挨揍吗，笨蛋？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.66,1:33:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的臭嘴，别让大家惊慌！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.67,1:33:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊慌？你笨得连惊慌也不会写，别和我谈惊慌
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.25,1:33:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们才要恐慌，我们完蛋了！- 到底是谁的错？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.71,1:33:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.76,1:33:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.15,1:33:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都没有办法了 - 不出奇
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.70,1:33:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 外面怎么样？- 好主意
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.29,1:33:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天后日出，现在零下40度
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.71,1:33:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,救援队10小时后来临，真是秒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.42,1:33:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那怪物把我们当午餐！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.84,1:33:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫所有仍生还的人集合
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.55,1:34:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,到大厅聚集
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.89,1:34:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.22,1:34:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她上哪里去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.96,1:34:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.92,1:34:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意吓你
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.93,1:34:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该一个人乱走
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.05,1:34:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我个忙，替我按键盘
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.05,1:34:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.19,1:35:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我该怎么做？- 按B或C
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.48,1:35:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,C是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.28,1:35:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 显示生命机能 - 就是那个
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.78,1:35:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了，现在呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.53,1:35:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它转一圈
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.50,1:35:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很模糊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.41,1:35:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,按放大键
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.94,1:35:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续看
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.85,1:35:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不懂这玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.53,1:35:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果出血就有暗色块
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.70,1:36:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在头骨根部…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.37,1:36:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,找细微裂痕
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.33,1:36:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小小的白线
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.00,1:36:13.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（异体组组）
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.72,1:36:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.43,1:36:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你体内也有一只
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.27,1:36:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.86,1:36:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样子？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.75,1:36:39.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（DNA资料扫描中 组组类型不明）
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.82,1:36:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太可怕了 - 我得看看它
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.37,1:36:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 定格 - 你最好别看
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.37,1:36:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,定格！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.77,1:37:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很难过！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.59,1:37:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怪物还在，它逃出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.97,1:37:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,救援队带着武器，快到达了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.43,1:37:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在危机四伏
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.35,1:37:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家在这里集合
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.39,1:37:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有空调
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.56,1:37:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果怪物来了，一定走大门
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.86,1:37:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有人守门，怪物来了才知道
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.82,1:37:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在先躲好，准备好迎接它…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.34,1:37:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一你的大限来临
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.56,1:37:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦，少鬼话连篇
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.64,1:37:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会被困死在这里的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.73,1:38:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有武器小刀的，拿出来用吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.57,1:38:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，用小刀就能杀死怪物？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.40,1:38:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死个毛
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.16,1:38:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能在被杀死前令它受伤？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.16,1:38:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个主意，谁有更好的主意？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.92,1:38:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你们，等救援队到达前我们已经死光！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.01,1:38:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家先作准备吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.35,1:38:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不留在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.56,1:38:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.53,1:38:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,点火
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.83,1:39:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是熔炉 - 对，我们把它弄到熔炉里
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.84,1:39:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天哪
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.17,1:39:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下好了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.84,1:39:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.01,1:39:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真他妈的 - 说得对
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.41,1:39:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定好了，你想说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.58,1:39:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他们说这里充满毒气
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.50,1:39:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.29,1:39:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,救援小组会折返
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.88,1:39:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 你在胡说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.51,1:39:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得靠他们杀死怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.43,1:39:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也许能想办法把你冷藏起来
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.76,1:40:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手术，他们有技术
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.18,1:40:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是异形逃走，就会杀光所有人
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.06,1:40:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,公司根本不在乎
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.44,1:40:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只想拿它来研究生化武器
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.48,1:40:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让他们来
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.28,1:40:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,管你的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.45,1:40:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾你体内有那东西，可是他们得救我
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.29,1:40:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管那些囚犯，我有老婆、孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.79,1:40:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下次轮到我回家 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.88,1:40:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我要传送这讯息，我要密码
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.63,1:40:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，这是机密
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.72,1:40:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这笨蛋一定要这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.64,1:40:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别无选择！- 没门
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.14,1:40:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会给你密码，不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.73,1:40:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，我跟你无冤无仇
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.68,1:40:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.57,1:40:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你会没有事
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.99,1:41:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.00,1:41:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么主意吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.46,1:41:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不会杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.18,1:41:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我孕育新王后
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.68,1:41:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不会杀死自己的未来
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.98,1:41:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怪物有这么聪明？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.85,1:41:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我去找它，看它到底有多聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.48,1:41:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要去找它？- 对
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.86,1:41:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道它在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.53,1:41:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就在下面，地下室
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.62,1:41:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这整个地方都是地下室
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.25,1:41:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是打个比喻，你来不来？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.92,1:42:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我日
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.75,1:42:06.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（收到逃生艇扫描资料）
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.70,1:42:22.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（紧急医疗小组将在2小时内到达）
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.85,1:42:25.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（最高优先考虑：隔离蕾普莉中尉）
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.15,1:42:31.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（等待确认）
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.47,1:43:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要找你时你在哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.00,1:43:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.47,1:44:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的家人
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.49,1:45:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进入我的生命这么久
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.62,1:45:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不记得其他事情
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.42,1:45:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在帮我个忙吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.38,1:45:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.42,1:45:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.30,1:45:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要发挥你的本能
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.39,1:46:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它不肯杀我 - 你应该躲起来
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.35,1:46:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我体内也有一只
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.02,1:46:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,大只的怪物不肯杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.77,1:46:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么？- 我刚刚看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.99,1:46:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时前
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.74,1:46:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就站在它旁边
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.20,1:46:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可以杀我 可是它不杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.29,1:46:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.96,1:46:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,它知道我在孕育它的后代
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.29,1:46:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说，你怎么知道你体内也有？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.55,1:46:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我透过断层扫描看到它
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.22,1:46:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是个王后，会产卵
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.39,1:46:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会生出上千个这种怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.47,1:47:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来还是胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.27,1:47:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西是怎么进入你体内？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.43,1:47:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.53,1:47:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在长眠的时候吧
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.03,1:47:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,它攻击我
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.99,1:47:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我成为王后之母
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.12,1:47:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的时间不多
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.88,1:47:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法做我该做的事
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.67,1:47:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.22,1:47:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得杀死我
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.35,1:47:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在胡说什么？- 反正我死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.06,1:47:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活不了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.73,1:47:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我体内的异形会繁殖上千只后代
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.49,1:47:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以杀光整个宇宙
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.36,1:47:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一定得死
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.95,1:47:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须有人杀死我
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.00,1:48:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你办得到吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.08,1:48:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点你不必担心
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.60,1:48:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必致词
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.86,1:48:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不必祷告
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.48,1:49:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？- 我不喜欢服输
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.65,1:49:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对任何人或物都一样
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.98,1:49:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西杀死半数的弟兄
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.53,1:49:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一半也被吓得半死
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.45,1:49:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要它还活着，你就别想拯救宇宙
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.62,1:49:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你杀了我
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.33,1:49:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是胆小鬼 - 我要捉住它
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.28,1:49:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你帮我逮住它
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.87,1:49:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不肯杀你，也许对我们有利
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.16,1:49:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就少说废话！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.17,1:49:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不帮忙就去死
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.17,1:49:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.93,1:49:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉这怪物之后
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.60,1:49:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就得除掉我 - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.06,1:49:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会死得痛快，不受折磨
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.32,1:50:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,由你自己决定
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.74,1:50:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想坐以待毙还是奋战到死
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.74,1:50:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们该试试，让它好看
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.41,1:50:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它把我们都害惨了，应该来个以牙还牙
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.13,1:50:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要怎么做？- 你在胡说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.92,1:50:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说去杀了那混帐东西
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.63,1:50:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，救援队要来了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.97,1:50:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要等就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.30,1:50:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要救援谁呢？- 我们呀
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.98,1:50:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只想要怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.15,1:50:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管他们要什么
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.90,1:50:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会逐个接走吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.50,1:50:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我不敢说
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.25,1:50:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是来带我们回家的
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.59,1:50:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.96,1:50:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不必跟它拼命
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.96,1:50:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊，饶了我们！- 你们都是笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.09,1:50:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有老婆孩子 - 没有人睬你，85
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.81,1:50:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是我们的一员，你没有信仰
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.39,1:51:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你只是个臭员工 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.14,1:51:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是员工，不是臭囚犯
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.81,1:51:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直骂我笨
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.40,1:51:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码我够聪明，不像你们永远被关在这里！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.69,1:51:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去你的头 - 滚开，85！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.61,1:51:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我够聪明，我会等武器来了再上战场！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.28,1:51:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗，莫尔斯？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.03,1:51:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，你就乖乖坐在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.83,1:51:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要乖乖坐在这里儿
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.71,1:51:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题，我忘了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.25,1:51:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你向上帝祈求…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.29,1:51:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,获得永生
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.01,1:51:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余的胆小鬼也可以坐着不动
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.38,1:51:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和她会负责打仗
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.55,1:51:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，不过我要杀死它
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.64,1:51:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨透那东西，它也杀死我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.77,1:51:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不等到公司把枪运来再动手？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.40,1:51:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为何一定要白白送死？- 对
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.07,1:51:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为公司不会杀死它
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.74,1:51:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能杀了你们灭口
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.37,1:52:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,太荒谬了，胡说八道，他们不会杀我们！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.01,1:52:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们第一次听到有异形
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.14,1:52:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说可以牺牲船员
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.52,1:52:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次派去的海军陆战队也一样可以牺牲
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.32,1:52:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道他们会在乎…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.24,1:52:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,关在外太空的囚犯吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.24,1:52:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道他们会让你们…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.66,1:52:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏他们的计划吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.08,1:52:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为我们是垃圾
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.75,1:52:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就不在乎你们的…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.17,1:52:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,死活
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.46,1:52:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人在乎
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.30,1:52:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有计划吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.43,1:52:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个铸铅厂，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.31,1:52:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要把异形丢进模子
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.44,1:52:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它溺死在滚烫的铅里
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.73,1:52:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我们该怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.94,1:53:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，谁来当饵？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.58,1:53:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 你们迟早都得死
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.46,1:53:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是怎样死法
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.46,1:53:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方很适合…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.17,1:53:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,做上天堂的第一步
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.43,1:53:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题只是要如何上去
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.10,1:53:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要死得轰轰烈烈…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.14,1:53:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是跪地求饶呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.02,1:53:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会求饶
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.61,1:53:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有人饶过我
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.53,1:53:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说干掉那怪物，跟他拼命
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.28,1:53:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我们跟它拼了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.79,1:53:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞死它 - 它冲过来怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.63,1:54:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好先想出好办法来
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.72,1:54:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号门开启
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.80,1:54:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们几时用过这地方？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.14,1:54:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,五、六年前用过
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.48,1:54:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定活塞还能用？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.19,1:54:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有一样东西能确定
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.12,1:54:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,它被困进去你就拉下把手，关起活塞
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.62,1:54:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它推下模子，然后把铅倒进去
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.21,1:54:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单，它死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.00,1:54:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要是有人搞砸呢？- 那就完蛋了，我们只有一次机会
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.88,1:54:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一击即中
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.76,1:54:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间重新再来，记住，当你拉下把手
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.35,1:54:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会和那怪物困在里面一会儿
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.68,1:54:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不出差错，我也不会
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.02,1:54:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,它最好真的不肯杀你
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.02,1:54:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,它想逃出去只有一条路
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.07,1:54:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过凹槽，通过你
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.86,1:55:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在哪里？- 我在附近
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.45,1:55:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其他人呢？- 在祷告
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.21,1:55:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你相信有天堂吗？- 不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.09,1:55:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.05,1:55:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶，还有什么能相信呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.01,1:55:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是事实
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.22,1:55:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.02,1:55:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,去它的，对不？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.37,1:55:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不到…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.76,1:56:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作要迅速
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.27,1:56:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,七号门关闭
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.61,1:56:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不妙
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.03,1:56:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位，我的门坏了 - 他在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.78,1:56:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好重新考虑！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.71,1:56:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人听到声音吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.80,1:56:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来抓我呀，王八蛋！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.39,1:56:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在后面！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.98,1:57:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开始了 - 在后面！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.15,1:57:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在B通道
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.86,1:57:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在后面，快关门！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.45,1:57:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一定朝A通道去了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.91,1:57:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怪物真的发怒了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.62,1:57:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你刚刚说B吗？- 不，E
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.17,1:57:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫我留在这里 - 动作快点
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.67,1:57:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔斯？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.13,1:57:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.65,1:57:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到文生了！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.53,1:57:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,丑八怪！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.70,1:57:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来抓我呀，快来呀，用力一点
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.17,1:58:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文，你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.38,1:58:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,A7关闭
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.93,1:58:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在东厢，B7关闭！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.24,1:58:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也在这儿？- 大家都到E通道！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.61,1:58:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- E通道在哪里？- 这里
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.95,1:58:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,特洛伊？特洛伊？好，快追
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.83,1:58:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样过来？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.59,1:58:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去哪里？怎么不照计划？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.26,1:58:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你免疫了，他们可没有 - 那该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.35,1:58:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 随机应变！- 随机应变
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.89,1:58:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下好了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.83,1:59:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！猫咪！过来！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.12,1:59:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！猫咪！猫咪！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.50,1:59:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.83,1:59:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这畜牲
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.51,1:59:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它过来了，从隧道过来 ！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.26,1:59:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它盯上我们了，照计划把门关上！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.52,1:59:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪，在上面！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.94,1:59:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦，来人呀，这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.31,1:59:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文、格雷戈尔
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.19,1:59:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.41,1:59:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又回到A通道
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.87,2:00:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关上
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.55,2:00:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,第3道门，F通道已关闭！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.51,2:00:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望是
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.14,2:00:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,操！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.60,2:00:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.35,2:00:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那样拿，这样拿
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.27,2:00:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会刺死人，蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.78,2:00:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔斯、凯文
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.57,2:00:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷戈尔
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.41,2:00:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只要跑过通道就行
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.29,2:00:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这里
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.38,2:00:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它到底在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.79,2:01:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了，老天，在那里
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.97,2:01:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要打开活塞！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.72,2:01:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得先困住它！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.39,2:01:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？它跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.31,2:01:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.19,2:01:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.61,2:01:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.98,2:02:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼东西？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.86,2:02:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.49,2:02:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文，不要挣扎
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.11,2:02:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动，不要挣扎
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.62,2:02:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀！来呀！凯文！来呀！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.49,2:02:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀！来呀！来呀！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.83,2:02:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关门！- 它来了！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.42,2:02:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备活塞！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.88,2:02:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！没事了！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.88,2:03:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！没事了！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.59,2:03:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了，凯文！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.97,2:03:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.35,2:03:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.73,2:03:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他放下
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.52,2:03:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他放下，他死了，引它进来
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.96,2:03:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶，还要多久？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.21,2:03:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不确定，四、五分钟
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.09,2:03:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得在活塞封闭之前把它引回这里
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.22,2:03:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快行动！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.41,2:04:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命！- 朱德！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.50,2:04:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦！救命！迪伦！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.67,2:04:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在追我！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.13,2:04:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别往后看，赶快跑！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.35,2:04:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦！救我！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.68,2:04:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦！救我！拜托！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.03,2:04:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,C通道，三号门关闭
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.58,2:05:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地，你们终于来了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.67,2:05:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,狱吏亚伦，长官，137512
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.17,2:05:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 幸存的人不多 - 蕾普莉中尉呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.14,2:05:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她还活着吗？- 她还活着，就在熔炉那里
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.56,2:05:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和怪物在铸铅厂
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.73,2:05:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不肯等你们
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.41,2:05:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天 - 你这浑蛋把我吓得半死！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.91,2:05:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是那怪物，大笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:45.59,2:05:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.45,2:06:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀！你这畜牲！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.33,2:06:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀！来呀！离开这里！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.38,2:06:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.47,2:06:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉！时间无多！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.18,2:06:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉！你在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.20,2:06:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:58.77,2:07:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面！我在上面！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.30,2:07:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀！过来！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.38,2:07:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？你有病吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.34,2:07:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过它！放过它！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.76,2:07:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好！成功了！到活塞！- 快尖叫！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.68,2:07:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到活塞！- 快尖叫！让它跟来
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.52,2:07:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它引到活塞前
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.69,2:07:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来！跟上来了！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.07,2:07:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！你这怪物
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.65,2:07:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.65,2:07:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,到门边！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.03,2:07:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀！混蛋！来呀！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.83,2:07:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！把门关上！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.08,2:07:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把门关上！- 莫尔斯！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.17,2:07:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关门！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.88,2:07:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔斯，把门关上！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.09,2:07:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔斯，把门关上！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.92,2:07:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点！- 把门关上！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.22,2:07:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去倒热铅
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.38,2:08:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在 - 你呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.89,2:08:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要留下 - 这里会灌进十顿热铅
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.35,2:08:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说过，我想死 - 我们说好了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.52,2:08:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？它先死，然后才是你
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.15,2:08:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不走我也不走，快走吧
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.71,2:09:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪伦 - 我在这儿挡住它
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.54,2:09:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我呢？- 上帝会照顾你，妹子
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.88,2:09:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.88,2:09:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把热铅倒下来
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.10,2:09:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.39,2:09:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快倒！蕾普莉！快呀！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:31.98,2:09:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把铅倒下来，蕾普莉，快点！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.53,2:09:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊！你只有这点能耐？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.74,2:09:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有这点能耐？来呀！浑蛋！快点！倒呀！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.16,2:09:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔斯！这里！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.49,2:09:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蕾普莉 - 把铅倒下去！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.29,2:09:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,把铅倒下去
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.75,2:09:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒下去
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.77,2:10:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,最讨厌虫子了！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.92,2:11:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉，它热得滚烫！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.80,2:11:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开洒水器！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.34,2:11:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,淋死这王八蛋！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.46,2:12:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉你了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.09,2:12:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了！
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.91,2:13:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要再过来 - 等等，他们是来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,2:13:11.53,2:13:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.94,2:13:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蕾普莉 - 主教
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.36,2:13:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是来帮助你的 - 别再骗我了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.95,2:13:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在我体内蠕动
Dialogue: 0,2:13:24.62,2:13:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道我是谁吗？- 你是个生化人
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.04,2:13:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,与主教同型号，公司派来的
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.13,2:13:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是主教那种生化人
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.25,2:13:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我设计的
Dialogue: 0,2:13:37.59,2:13:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是人类
Dialogue: 0,2:13:40.18,2:13:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,公司派个熟悉面孔来找你
Dialogue: 0,2:13:42.55,2:13:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,表示你有多重要
Dialogue: 0,2:13:46.39,2:13:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我也是
Dialogue: 0,2:13:48.10,2:13:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你只想把它带回去 - 我们要杀了它，带你回家
Dialogue: 0,2:13:51.44,2:13:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 才怪 - 你错了，我们想帮你
Dialogue: 0,2:13:56.53,2:13:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.07,2:14:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会替你取出它 - 然后留它活口
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.48,2:14:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让它活着，否则人类将面临危机
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.57,2:14:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想把它带回去？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:11.91,2:14:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉，时间不多，我们要赶快解决这个恶魔
Dialogue: 0,2:14:17.75,2:14:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,救援舰有手术台
Dialogue: 0,2:14:21.92,2:14:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来吧，手术快速
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.59,2:14:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,无痛，只要几刀，两小时就好了
Dialogue: 0,2:14:33.51,2:14:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切就结束了
Dialogue: 0,2:14:40.77,2:14:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能过正常生活，生儿育女
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.53,2:14:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的，你会知道它真正死了
Dialogue: 0,2:14:50.70,2:14:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我帮你吧
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.12,2:14:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎样肯定…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:58.58,2:15:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把它取出来，就会消灭它？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.96,2:15:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得相信我
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.88,2:15:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你相信我
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.85,2:15:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.86,2:15:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样有什么用？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.66,2:15:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 住手！- 老天！
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.76,2:15:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔斯！
Dialogue: 0,2:15:42.29,2:15:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你愿意帮助我吗？- 你要我做什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:49.59,2:15:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个误会，你们不该伤人
Dialogue: 0,2:15:53.09,2:15:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶的生化人
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.03,2:16:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是生化人
Dialogue: 0,2:16:18.58,2:16:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉，想想能从它身上学到的
Dialogue: 0,2:16:23.12,2:16:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是毕生难逢的机会
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.34,2:16:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得让我留下它，它是个优秀生物！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.55,2:16:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.39,2:16:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要拍摄！
Dialogue: 0,2:17:06.79,2:17:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:09.13,2:17:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.35,2:17:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,2:18:22.99,2:18:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点！快点走！- 去你的！
Dialogue: 0,2:18:33.04,2:18:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾许和达拉斯船长都死了
Dialogue: 0,2:18:36.47,2:18:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,货物和船全部被毁
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.34,2:18:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在六周后将抵达边界
Dialogue: 0,2:18:44.64,2:18:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的话，有人会来拯救
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.44,2:18:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.48,2:18:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺斯托罗莫号唯一生还者，报告完毕
Dialogue: 0,2:18:55.30,2:18:58.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（「复仇」161星球 劳动监狱关闭封锁）
Dialogue: 0,2:18:58.99,2:19:01.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（监管驻防事务终止）
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.16,2:19:04.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（存留铸炼设备 当废铁出售）
Dialogue: 0,2:19:04.25,2:19:07.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（传讯完毕）
